{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_325","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: PROGRESS.md\n@@\n-- Implemented the activity catalog, unstable balance physics, progression, synthesized audio, 3D island, screens, local profiles, and family sessions. The first standalone HTML bundle builds successfully; runtime and cross-browser validation are next.\n+- Implemented the activity catalog, unstable balance physics, progression, synthesized audio, 3D island, screens, local profiles, family sessions, and AI Hub client integration. The standalone HTML builds successfully.\n@@\n-- The browser runtime, AI Hub round synchronization, automated tests, interview, and viewport checks still need verification and completion.\n+- \"'`npm test` passes 28 checks, including activity simulations, profile/day progression, family play, the WebGPU scene, and Chromium/Firefox/WebKit browser flows.\n+- The viewport matrix reports 24 clean phone, foldable, tablet, and desktop configurations. Selected WebKit and Chromium screenshots have been inspected.\n+- Fixed an unsupported-WebGPU startup overlay and an oversized title encountered during browser testing.\n+- Next: validate the official AI Hub harness and standalone `file://` launch, inspect in-game layouts, address important gaps, and replace interview placeholders.\n+- The implementation is a simplified interpretation of the extensive plan: in particular, family play is sequential and the activities share the island scene rather than having full bespoke animated environments.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nprintf '\"'\\\\n--- GAME BRIEF ---\\\\n'; sed -n '64,112p' PLAN.md; sed -n '183,332p' PLAN.md; sed -n '552,603p' PLAN.md; sed -n '856,915p' PLAN.md\nprintf '\\\\n--- MAIN STRUCTURE ---\\\\n'; rg -n '\"'^(function|const |let |class |export |AIHub|window'\"\\\\.)|hub|family|live-cue' 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/src/main.js'\nprintf '\\\\n--- SESSION ---\\\\n'; cat 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/src/core/session.js'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_325","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: PROGRESS.md\n@@\n-- Implemented the activity catalog, unstable balance physics, progression, synthesized audio, 3D island, screens, local profiles, and family sessions. The first standalone HTML bundle builds successfully; runtime and cross-browser validation are next.\n+- Implemented the activity catalog, unstable balance physics, progression, synthesized audio, 3D island, screens, local profiles, family sessions, and AI Hub client integration. The standalone HTML builds successfully.\n@@\n-- The browser runtime, AI Hub round synchronization, automated tests, interview, and viewport checks still need verification and completion.\n+- \"'`npm test` passes 28 checks, including activity simulations, profile/day progression, family play, the WebGPU scene, and Chromium/Firefox/WebKit browser flows.\n+- The viewport matrix reports 24 clean phone, foldable, tablet, and desktop configurations. Selected WebKit and Chromium screenshots have been inspected.\n+- Fixed an unsupported-WebGPU startup overlay and an oversized title encountered during browser testing.\n+- Next: validate the official AI Hub harness and standalone `file://` launch, inspect in-game layouts, address important gaps, and replace interview placeholders.\n+- The implementation is a simplified interpretation of the extensive plan: in particular, family play is sequential and the activities share the island scene rather than having full bespoke animated environments.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nprintf '\"'\\\\n--- GAME BRIEF ---\\\\n'; sed -n '64,112p' PLAN.md; sed -n '183,332p' PLAN.md; sed -n '552,603p' PLAN.md; sed -n '856,915p' PLAN.md\nprintf '\\\\n--- MAIN STRUCTURE ---\\\\n'; rg -n '\"'^(function|const |let |class |export |AIHub|window'\"\\\\.)|hub|family|live-cue' 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/src/main.js'\nprintf '\\\\n--- SESSION ---\\\\n'; cat 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/src/core/session.js'\"","aggregated_output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM PROGRESS.md\n\n--- GAME BRIEF ---\n## 3. Structure of play\n\n### Menu map\n\n```\nTitle (\"Press any button. Gently.\")      idle 10 s on title or any menu -> Attract\n└ Main Menu\n  ├ The Week        pick one of 3 guest slots -> Continue day N / start a week -> Island\n  ├ Drop-In Class   any activity at once, all open, records only, no Drips or story\n  ├ Family Hour     1-4 players on this screen -> Join -> The Medley -> Podium\n  ├ Settings\n  └ About & Credits\n```\n\nIn an AI Hub session none of this appears: the game opens on its own card, then the Medley (section 12).\n\n### Starting a week\n\nName entry, one of 6 preset avatars (the Locker Room changes it later), then the ferry cutscene and Ounce's introduction, which teaches the Dot before the first test: \"This dot is you. Keep it in the circle.\" Then the first Weigh-In. Ounce also asks \"How old do you feel? This is not binding.\" with a number picker; the answer is used once, in the joke when the Wobble Age arrives, and never saved.\n\n### A day in The Week\n\n1. **Morning Weigh-In** (about 45 s, section 6): balance test, one absurd question, today's Wobble Age.\n2. **Free time on the island:** walk between stations, do what you like. Coach's prescription (a daily goal) pays a bonus. Ounce follows and comments.\n3. **Hammock** ends the day once you've done at least one activity. Leaving early earns a guilt-trip, never a block.\n4. **Evening Report** (about 20 s): minutes, Drips, stars, the chart, tomorrow's \"concern\", new unlocks. The light goes to dusk (`applySky(engine, skyAt(19))`), then fade to morning.\n\n### The week\n\n| Day | Test | Coach's prescription (+5 Drips) | Opens today | Story beat |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Stillness | Holding Still and one other | Apologetic Tree, Startled Heron, Squats of Regret, Hoop Economics | Ferry. \"Please step on me.\" \"Ow.\" \"This dot is you. Keep it in the circle. That's it. That's the game. Everything else is decoration.\" |\n| 2 | Lean | 2★ in anything | Coconut Header, Apology Lunges, Reluctant Warrior (adds breathing), Locker Room | Dennis explains the deck chair. Nobody asked. |\n| 3 | Chase | Something you haven't done | Step Class, Slackline, The Chair Nobody Asked For | Marguerite: \"Has anyone ever checked that scale?\" Ounce: \"I'd like to weigh in on that. No.\" |\n| 4 | Stillness | 3 activities | Vitamin Tray, Overhead Mortgage, Tax Season | Coach hangs her plumb line by Ounce. \"You are leaning.\" \"The island is leaning.\" |\n| 5 | Lean | Beat Dennis at anything | Island Jog, Pier Jump, Plank Negotiation | Kevin sits on Ounce. The dial reads 7. Nobody says anything. |\n| 6 | Chase | 3★ anywhere | Hard versions of everything | Ounce rehearses a speech, badly, behind the Sweat Jar. |\n| 7 | Stillness | Stand. | The Long Stand, then the ending | The confession. The chart slides. Credits. |\n\n### Progress\n\n- **Stars:** every activity gives 0-3★ from thresholds in its data.\n- **Drips:** `2 + 3 × stars + floor(playSeconds / 30)`, plus the +5 goal bonus. They fill the **Sweat Jar**.\n- **Jar milestones** at 10, 25, 45, 70, 100, 135 and 175 Drips each unlock a Locker Room item (second headband, towel cape, \"Confidence: no visible effect\", and so on) and a remark.\n- **Records:** per activity, compared with data-table scores for Dennis (low), June (mid-high) and Marguerite (high). A classmate you beat reacts in the Report.\n- **Saves:** `localStorage`, versioned JSON, one key, 3 guest slots, written after every activity and day. Handle missing storage (Node, private mode) with an in-memory fallback.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Activities\n\n### Shared flow (`src/scenes/activity/base.js`)\n\n`intro` (camera glide, Coach's one line, a card with goal and controls for the current device) → `practice` (first time only: 8 s, unscored, \"Try it.\") → `countdown` → `play` → `outro` → **Results** (stars pop in one by one, score, Drips, a line chosen by activity and stars, classmates' scores) → Retry / Next / Back.\n\n- Each activity is a scene plus a data entry in `src/data/activities.js`: id, name, station, camera, song, tunables, star thresholds, unlock day, `hard` overrides, lines.\n- No fail states. Falls cost points and dignity.\n- **Each activity defines its bot play for a given skill** (circling at a set speed, pressing within a timing error, heading the nearest coconut). The Dot bots in section 4 cover the balance parts. Classmates, attract mode and the tests all use it.\n- Every activity must be readable within 5 seconds with no text.\n- **Hard versions** apply data overrides (smaller rings, faster tempo).\n- **Lanes:** Holding Still, Reps, Hoop, Header and Step run in **lane staging**, up to 4 mats in a row, each with its own driver (local, bot or ghost). Solo play puts you on the centre mat with two classmates as bots.\n\n**Lane camera ✔ (3 mats):** `{ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 2.3, 8.2], target: [0, 1.15, 0], fov: 30 }`, mats at x = -2.2, 0, 2.2, z = 0.8. **For 4 mats ✔:** position `[0, 3, 9.5]`, target `[0, 1, 0]`, fov 32, mats at x = -3, -1, 1, 3. Multiply the distance by `max(1, (16/9) / aspect)` so narrow windows don't clip the outer mats.\n\n**Staging rules ✔ (found in test renders):**\n- Put Coach to one side of the player, not directly behind; their silhouettes merged.\n- Never draw the dial over an avatar. In 3-mat staging the sky above the player's head is empty: centre the dial at (W/2, 56), radius 44.\n- Make all HUD lines at least 2 art px thick. A 1 px ring vanishes at 10 feet.\n\n**Lean body language:** after `mixer.update(dt)`, add the Dot to the pose: `torso.rotateZ(-dot.x * 0.18); torso.rotateX(-dot.y * 0.12); pelvis.position.x += dot.x * 0.05`. Outside the ring, add a tremble. Far outside, blend to the kit's `Teeter` clip. The player should be able to read the Dot from the body alone.\n\n### 5.1 Holding Still (Pavilion, yoga)\n\nCoach demonstrates on a dais. You hold the pose by keeping the Dot in the ring: settle 4 s (unscored), hold, release 2 s.\n\n| Pose | Clip | Ring | Twist | Hold | Breath |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Apologetic Tree | Tree | .40 | none | 25 s | none |\n| Startled Heron | Heron | .36 | slow bias wander, ±.12 on x | 25 s | none |\n| Reluctant Warrior | Warrior | .32 | y noise ×1.3 | 30 s | 8 s |\n| The Chair Nobody Asked For | Chair | .30 | noise ramps 1→1.5 | 30 s | 8 s |\n| Tax Season | Fold | .28 | bias wander ±.18 | 30 s | 6 s |\n| Plank Negotiation | Plank | .24 | inst ×1.2, tremor after 20 s | 35 s | 6 s |\n\n- **Breath:** a bar rises and falls (\"In…\" / \"Out…\"). Hold R2 / Space / left mouse on In, release on Out. Keep a sync value `s` (0..1, smoothed), and `m.noise *= 1.25 - 0.55 * s`, so breathing well literally calms you.\n- **Score:** `100 × inRing`, or `100 × (0.8 × inRing + 0.2 × breath)` when breath is on. Stars 45/70/90.\n- **Juice:** chime when the Dot enters the ring, ring brightens with time inside, slow camera push-in while steady, classmates wobbling, Kevin on the rail, sunbeams, dust motes.\n\n### 5.2 The Rep Shed (strength)\n\n**You scrub the animation with the stick** ✔ (`action.paused = true; action.time = r * duration; mixer.update(0)`). A marker on a big vertical (or horizontal) track follows the tempo curve; you match it.\n\n| Exercise | Clip | Input | Reps | Tempo |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Squats of Regret | SquatRep | stick down = deeper | 10 | 3.2 s |\n| Apology Lunges | LungeRep, mirrored for left | stick left/right, targets alternate | 10 | 3.2 s |\n| Overhead Mortgage | Press (new) | stick up = press; `repLag` ×1.5 (heavy) | 8 | 3.6 s |\n\n- **Target per rep:** 0→1 in 40% of the tempo, hold 15%, 1→0 in 35%, rest 10%. `r` follows the input with lag `repLag` 0.10 s.\n- **Keyboard uses rate control:** S/W move `r` at the target speed, no key holds it. Otherwise keys could only slam between ends.\n- **Rep quality:** `1 - 1.6 × mean|r - target|`, shown as Perfect ≥ .85, Good ≥ .65, else Wobbly. Score = mean × 100. Stars 55/75/90.\n- **Fatigue:** tremor on `r`, amplitude `repFatigue × (rep/total)²`, default .10.\n- **The gag:** Coach says \"Last one.\" Then \"Last one.\" Then \"I lied. This is the last one.\" Every exercise runs 2 reps past its announced end.\n- **Set dressing:** a gym wall with the engine's `Mirror` showing your reps (attach in `setup`, stop in `dispose`); giant dumbbells.\n\n### 5.3 Hoop Economics (Beat Beach, aerobics)\n\n**Circle the stick** (or the mouse, or roll W-D-S-A) to keep hoops up.\n\n- Angular speed: from unwrapped `atan2(u)` when `|u| > .5`, smoothed .25 s. Band: `hoopLow` 0.9 to `hoopHigh` 2.4 rev/s, in the current direction.\n- Lift `L`: +.35/s in band, -.25/s out of band, -.5/s wrong way. At 0 the hoop drops, and you pick it up for 1.5 s, with comment.\n- 60 s: anticlockwise 25 s; \"Now the other way.\" clockwise 25 s; either way 10 s.\n- **Thrown hoops:** every ~9 s June winds up on one side, with 1.5 s of telegraph and a landing shadow. Flick `|u.x| > .7` toward that side in the last .4 s to catch it. Up to 4 hoops, each adding +0.5 to the rotation multiplier. Flicking interrupts your circling, which is the trade-off.\n- Score = weighted rotations in band. Stars 35/70/110.\n- **Look:** torus meshes orbiting the hips, tilt by `L`, pelvis circling, sparkles in band.\n\n### 5.4 Step Class (Beat Beach, rhythm)\n\nFootprints scroll to a hit line. Left foot: L1 or L2 / F or ← / left mouse button. Right foot: R1 or R2 / J or → / right mouse button.\n\n- 104 BPM, 32 bars (about 74 s): intro 4, verse 8, chorus 8, breakdown 4, final 8. Charts are strings in data: `L.R.L.R.`.\n- Windows: Perfect ±55 ms, Good ±100, OK ±140 (scale `stepWindow`). Accuracy = (P + .7G + .4O) / N. Stars 55/75/90.\n- **Beat clock:** the song's step clock when audio runs (`ctx.audio.song.start` and `ctx.audio.song.parsed.stepTime`, in the audio context's time; undocumented but present in 0.46.0), otherwise game time (headless, replays). A **Step timing offset** setting covers latency.\n- On pause: stop the music; on resume, count in and restart at the current bar.\n- Avatars step on platforms using the kit's `StepUp` / `StepDown` or your own. Classmates dance with occasional mistakes. Confetti at combo milestones.\n\n### 5.5 Coconut Header (Lagoon Games, balance)\n\nLean left and right along the sand. Dennis runs a catapult.\n\n- Lane ±2 m solo (±0.8 m in lanes). Speed 4.5 m/s × `u.x`.\n- Objects land at head height after 1.4 s with a shadow telegraph, interval 1.3 s → 0.7 s. 70% coconut (head it: +10 × combo tier), 25% flip-flop (dodge it, or -10, combo lost, .6 s daze with circling stars), 5% golden pineapple (+30).\n- Combo tiers ×2/×3/×4 at 5/10/20. 60 s. Stars 150/400/800.\n- Hitstop .05 s on each header. Squash the head. Coconuts fly back at Dennis, who stops being fine.\n\n### 5.6 Slackline (Lagoon Games, balance)\n\nA sagging line across the lagoon between giant dumbbells. Camera low behind you.\n\n- **X is balance, forward is progress.** Push forward (`u.y > .3`) to walk at 1.1 m/s. Walking is less stable, so stopping to recover is a real choice.\n- Defaults ✔ (simulated): effective instability 1.2 standing and 2.6 walking, so `m.inst = 1.2 / T.dotInstability` and `T.slackWalkInst / T.dotInstability`; `m.noise` 1.25; gusts every 6 m, `m.bx` ±1.6 for 1 s, telegraphed 1.5 s by flags and wind lines; fall at `|x| > 1`. Lock y (`dot.y = dot.vy = 0` after each step). Bots walk only while `|x| < .45`.\n- Fall: 1.2 s of slow motion, splash, back to the checkpoint (0/10/20 m). Kevin lands on your head at 18 m and adds a bias until 24 m. 30 m, 75 s limit.\n- Measured ✔: idle never finishes; sloppy rarely; average 38 s with 0.2 falls; good 28 s with 0 falls.\n- **Stars:** ★ finish; ★★ ≤ 1 fall and under 45 s; ★★★ 0 falls and under 32 s. Score `1000 - 60 × falls - 8 × (time - 27)`.\n- Sag the line under your feet (segments updated each frame). Arms out: the kit's `Tiptoe` plus T-pose arms set after the mixer, or a tuned `gaitClip`.\n\n### 5.7 Vitamin Tray (Lagoon Games, balance)\n\nTilt a lacquered tray to roll coloured vitamins into matching cups. Top-down-ish fixed camera.\n\n- **Tilt gravity, not the tray ✔:** the colliders stay flat and static; set `ctx.physics.world.gravity`; a visual `Group` tilts, with the vitamins as its children at `body.translation()`.\n- **The engine's gravity is -24**, not -9.8. Use `trayGravity` 9.8 here and restore it on leaving. Max tilt 14°, driven by `u` with .12 s lag. Enable CCD on the balls.\n- Cups are untagged cylinder triggers ✔ (they see dynamic bodies). 8 vitamins, 2-3 colours, 60 s. +10 correct, -3 wrong; rail gaps in later boards drop a vitamin (-1, respawns after 3 s).\n- Three boards as ASCII in data (`#` wall, `.` floor, `o` start, `R`/`B`/`Y` cups). Stars at 40/60/80% of the board's maximum.\n\n### 5.8 Island Jog (Jogging Path, aerobics)\n\nA rail run around the whole island, the showpiece for the world. `iso` camera following, zoom about 1.4, looking slightly ahead.\n\n- **Alternate left and right** (same inputs as Step) to build cadence (smoothed steps/s). Band 2.4-3.6 steps/s. Same side twice stumbles (-.5 s). Over 3.6 for 2 s gives a Stitch (speed ×.5 for 3 s, remark).\n- Coach paces you on a white mobility scooter at exactly target speed, 3 m/s. Path about 220 m on a Catmull-Rom curve (about 75 s). More than 12 m behind, she waits, unimpressed.\n- Stick X moves you ±1.5 m across the path: collect 18 water cups; dodge sprinklers, picnics, Dennis stretching, and Kevin.\n- Score `70 × pace% + 30 × cups%`. Stars 55/75/90.\n- Run clip: `gaitClip(HERO_RIG, { name: 'Jog', frames: 16, speed: 3, stance: .42, hip: -.04, bob: .03, lift: .1, lean: 6, sway: 2, arms: { swing: 30, elbow: 75 } })` ✔, with `action.timeScale = speed / 3`.\n\n### 5.9 Pier Jump (Lagoon Games, balance)\n\nSide-on (`side` preset), three attempts, three judges with paddles.\n\n1. **Run-up (5 s):** hold the Dot in a tuck zone (`y` -.8 to -.4) to build speed 6→14 m/s.\n2. **Lip:** press ✕ / Space / click as you reach it. Power `p = 1 - |Δt| / .25`.\n3. **Flight (3-4 s):** `m.inst` 3, ring .45; staying in the ring carries you farther.\n4. **Cannonball:** press in the last .5 s for style points. Splash: hitstop .1 s, `timeScale` .25 for .8 s, huge particles, ripples, shake.\n\nDistance = `speed × (.8 + .6p) × (.6 + .4 × ringFrac) × 2.14` m. Stars at 18/28/38 m on the best attempt. Judges react.\n\n### 5.10 The Long Stand (finale, Day 7)\n\nThe plaza at golden hour, everyone watching. Stillness scoring with this data timeline; no way to fail:\n\n| t (s) | Event | Effect |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0 | Coach: \"Stand.\" | ring .40 |\n| 10 | Kevin lands on your head | bias x +.10 |\n| 20 | Dennis sneezes | impulse y -.6 |\n| 30 | | ring .34 |\n| 35 | Light rain (`Precipitation`) | noise ×1.2 |\n| 45 | Marguerite applauds, slowly | Ounce: \"Ignore her.\" |\n| 50 | | ring .28 |\n| 55 | June: \"Are you nearly done?\" | text drifts across the dial |\n| 65 | Kettlebell Volcano rumbles | shake, random impulse |\n| 75 | Rain stops, sun out, music swells | ring .24 |\n| 85 | Kevin leaves | bias off, impulse |\n| 90 | Coach: \"You may blink.\" | end |\n\nThen the confession and ending, played with a `Timeline` (section 13). At 0★: \"You stood. Sort of.\"\n\n---\n\n## 12. Multiplayer\n\n**Reading of the brief:** the hub protocol is how the game plays online; on its own the game has no server, so it plays alone or on one screen. Both run the same round, **The Medley**, and the same lane code. Nothing else connects to a network.\n\n### The Medley\n\nThree events in fixed windows: Stillness (a pose), then Beat (Reps or Hoop or Step), then Balance-lean (Header), each 55 s with 10 s between, about 3.2 minutes. The specific picks and shortened durations live in `src/data/medley.js`, and the picks come from a seeded stream. Each event normalises to 0-1000; the total wins. Results show medals, awards (\"Stillest\", \"Most Apologetic\") and Ounce's remarks.\n\n### On its own: Family Hour\n\nJoin screen: **each device claims a mat by pressing Cross/Enter** (up to 4 pads plus keyboard-and-mouse). Bots can fill empty mats (toggle).\n\n**The engine merges all pads into one** ✔, so lanes read `navigator.getGamepads()` by index themselves (`applyDeadzone` is exported; guard for Node). In 4-mat staging, each player gets a small dial (radius 24) above their avatar's head. Podium, rematch.\n\n### In AI Hub: ghost mode\n\nPassed 16/16 with the real engine on WebGPU ✔ at players=1, 2, 4 (latency, jitter, loss) and host-leave.\n\n```html\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<script>/* session.js pasted unmodified: first script, right after charset */</script>\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"ghost\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Score the most across three events. Stay in the circle.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Left stick, WASD or mouse: lean. R2, Space or click: breathe. L1/R1, F/J: step.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:webgpu\" content=\"required\">\n```\n\nBoot order ✔:\n\n```js\nlet info = null;\nif (window.AIHub?.active) info = await AIHub.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true });\nconst engine = await Engine.start(firstScene, withUrlOptions({ /* ... */ seed: info ? info.seed : savedOrDefaultSeed }));\nif (info) AIHub.ready();                 // no key press, as soon as the card can show\n```\n\nIf `connect()` answers null, carry on as the normal game. Without WebGPU, `Engine.start` rejects and the engine prints \"Failed to start: WebGPU unavailable: ...\" on the page ✔. Catch the rejection, or it also surfaces as a page error ✔, and call `AIHub.fail(message)` in a session.\n\n**In a session:**\n- **The card (`card: true`)** is the game's own: the players' avatars lining up on mats in seat colours (`#e8443a #3b82f6 #22c55e #f5b700`), {TITLE}, ready ticks, how to win, the controls for the last device, the time left from the `card` event. Enter or Cross → `AIHub.answer('ready')`; Triangle or M → `AIHub.answer('more')`. Use a **direct `keydown` listener for Enter** ✔ here. No menus. Cosmetic randomness only from `AIHub.rng('card')`.\n- **Start:** on `start` show a countdown from `AIHub.time()`; play at `time() >= 0`. Event windows are read from `AIHub.time()`, so all copies stay in step.\n- **Same world:** gusts, pose picks and object waves come from `AIHub.rng(label)` or the seeded `ctx.random`.\n- **Ghosts:** a `setInterval` at 100 ms (not tied to rendering) sends `AIHub.send({ a: eventIndex, x, y, c: clipIndex, t: clipTime, s: score }, { reliable: false })` and calls `AIHub.progress({ score, label })`. Start as soon as `start` arrives, even with score 0: the harness needs both within seconds. Receivers lerp the other mats; they never simulate them, and they hide a ghost whose `a` differs from theirs.\n- **`leave`:** that avatar waves and walks off. The round goes on, host included.\n- **End:** `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })` once, at the end of the Medley or at once on `time-up`. On `end`: stop input, stop sound, send nothing.\n- **Never:** no title, attract, dev mode, saves, quit or restart; no chat or custom names; no `alert`, `window.open` or navigation. Names come from `info.players` and are drawn with `say()`.\n\n---\n\n### Hub harness ✔\n\nCopy the built html (as `game.html`) with `harness.html`, `bridge.js` and `round.js` into a temp folder inside the dev folder. Serve it with `python3 -u -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1` ✔, reading the port from its first output line and stopping it by its PID. An in-process `node:http` server on `127.0.0.1` and port 0 also works, but it must send `Content-Type: text/javascript` for `.js`, or the harness's module imports fail. Then for each of:\n\n```\nharness.html?game=game.html&auto=1&players=1\nharness.html?game=game.html&auto=1&players=2\nharness.html?game=game.html&auto=1&players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5\nharness.html?game=game.html&auto=1&players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave\n```\n\nwait for `document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'`, then require `window.__hubCheck.pass`; print failed checks' `name` and `detail`. Each took 10-13 s with a light scene. Keep the card scene light so `ready()` lands inside the 20 s limit even with 4 software-rendered copies. Confirm the served page is yours (its title) before trusting a result. Then open the game outside a session and check it still runs.\n\n### Headless facts ✔\n\n- 600 frames with mixers takes about 80 ms, and boot about 240 ms, so full playthroughs are cheap.\n- `Engine.headless(game, { camera })`: built-ins load with no asset reader.\n- `recording()` and `replay()` reproduce the fingerprint across `loadGame`.\n- `input.setPointer(x, y, true)` drives the mouse.\n- `ctx.audio` counts plays with no context.\n\n---\n\n## 18. Testing\n\n**One command: `node tools/test.mjs`** prints only failures and one count line (`212/212 passed`). `--fast` runs the Node tests only. Rerun only after changing what a test covers. Prefer scripts to screenshots. Don't use subagents or workflows to review, judge or audit. Keep at most two browsers open.\n\n**Headless (Node), seconds:**\n\n1. **Dot:** idle bot < 20% at ring .30; average 35-65%; good > 80%; expert > 95%.\n2. **Clips:** `validateClip` empty and `analyzeClip(...).problems` empty for every clip you wrote.\n3. **Data:** every model (`checkModel`) and texture (`validateTexture`) clean; all ids resolve; `parseSong` on every song; each song passes the level check in §15; every line fits its box; every character of every string has a glyph.\n4. **Every activity:** idle bot finishes with 0★ and no error; expert bot ≥ 2★ (≥ 3★ on easy ones); sloppy < expert; result written; Drips correct.\n5. **Full scripted playthrough:** drive the real menus with `setKey` from a fresh save, bots inside activities: new week → all 7 days → every station → goals → unlock schedule → Jar milestones → Long Stand → confession subtracts exactly 7 → credits → Week 2. Assert the state at each step.\n6. **Save:** reload mid-week restores; corrupt JSON falls back safely; no storage works.\n7. **Pause:** `timeScale` 0, `fixedUpdate` frozen, menu navigable, resume exact.\n8. **Dev:** every slider changes live behaviour; reset restores defaults; every tool works.\n9. **Attract:** 10 s idle on title and on a menu starts it; no trigger during play; a full loop runs error-free over all items; any input exits.\n10. **Determinism:** record an activity, replay it, fingerprints equal.\n11. **Medley:** 4 bot lanes, scores in range, windows respected; a ghost lane never simulates.\n12. **Voice:** `syllabify` is stable, the same word gives the same syllables, a question rises.\n13. **Engine untouched:** `pixel-engine.js` hash equals the kit's.\n\n**Browser, on the built html via `file://`:**\n\n14. Boots on WebGPU with no errors; title visible; **music volume is exactly 0.10** on first run.\n15. Pad stub: ✕ confirms; prompts show PlayStation glyphs; the Settings option gives Xbox; a key press switches to keycaps; mouse move switches to mouse prompts; hover moves focus; click activates. Record each prompt state in `App.state()` so no picture is needed.\n16. Phone profile with touch: message showing, ⚙ present, `engine.touch` null, attract runs.\n17. Family Hour with 2 stub pads plus keyboard: three lanes move independently.\n18. Audio after a real click: an `AnalyserNode` on the destination reads non-silent for SFX and music; voice in `OfflineAudioContext` has RMS > .02, and Ounce's mean pitch exceeds Coach's.\n19. No layout overflow at 1920×1080, 1280×720 and 640×360: widgets record their rects, and the test asserts all fit.\n20. WebKit (iPhone profile) and Firefox have no `navigator.gpu` on this machine ✔, so they can only test failure: the engine's \"Failed to start: WebGPU unavailable\" message shows ✔ and no page error is thrown. Test the touch-only screen itself in Chromium's phone profile, as in test 16.\n\n**Hub:**\n\n21. The four harness runs from section 17, all `pass`. Each harness frame is a separate copy of the game, which covers the brief's \"no second player\" note.\n22. Outside a session: normal boot with `AIHub.active` false.\n\n---\n\n\n--- MAIN STRUCTURE ---\n9:const ui=document.getElementById('ui');\n10:const stored=(key,fallback)=>{try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key))??fallback;}catch{return fallback;}};\n11:const escape=value=>String(value).replace(/[&<>\"']/g,character=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[character]));\n12:const app={screen:'title',session:null,settings:{music:.1,effects:.7,glyphs:'ps',contrast:false,motion:false,...stored('alob-settings',{})},profiles:stored('alob-profiles',[null,null,null]),slot:0,activity:null,result:null,tuning:{...DEFAULT_TUNABLES},input:{x:0,y:0,breath:false,left:false,right:false},keys:new Set(),lastInput:performance.now(),inputKind:'keyboard',focus:0,paused:false,attract:false,attractIndex:0,medley:null,weigh:null,hubRound:false,hubEnded:false,hubScores:{},hubClock:0,gamepadButtons:[],driver:null};\n13:const sound=new Sound(app.settings);\n14:const save=()=>{try{localStorage.setItem('alob-profiles',JSON.stringify(app.profiles));localStorage.setItem('alob-settings',JSON.stringify(app.settings));}catch{}};\n15:const profile=()=>app.guest||app.profiles[app.slot];\n16:const brand='<div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"brand-icon\">✳</span> LITTLE ISLAND WELLNESS</div>';\n17:const button=(label,action,extra='',style='')=>`<button class=\"button ${style}\" data-action=\"${action}\" ${extra}>${label}<span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button>`;\n18:const back=target=>`<button class=\"back\" data-action=\"${target}\" aria-label=\"Go back\">←</button>`;\n19:const panel=(content,extra='')=>`<section class=\"screen ${extra}\"><div class=\"panel glass\">${content}</div></section>`;\n20:const heading=(kicker,title,description)=>`<div class=\"eyebrow\">${kicker}</div><h1 class=\"heading\">${title}</h1><p class=\"description\">${description}</p>`;\n21:const hint=()=>app.inputKind==='gamepad'?`<span class=\"key\">${app.settings.glyphs==='xbox'?'A':'✕'}</span> SELECT <span class=\"key\">${app.settings.glyphs==='xbox'?'B':'◯'}</span> BACK`:'<span class=\"key\">↑↓</span> CHOOSE <span class=\"key\">ENTER</span> SELECT';\n22:const footer=()=>`<div class=\"footnote\">${hint()}</div>`;\n23:const notice=()=>matchMedia('(hover: none) and (pointer: coarse)').matches&&!app.keyboardSeen&&!Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).some(Boolean);\n24:const iconFor=family=>({still:'✳',reps:'↕',hoop:'◌',header:'◉',step:'♪',slack:'〰',tray:'♧',jog:'➜',jump:'↗'})[family]||'✳';\n26:function render(){\n31:    content=panel(`${brand}<h1 class=\"title\">${escape(TITLE.split(' ').slice(0,2).join(' '))}<br><span>${escape(TITLE.split(' ').slice(2).join(' '))}.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">A week of movement, a talking scale, and absolutely no pressure to be graceful.</p><div class=\"title-tag\">YOUR ISLAND IS READY</div>${notice()?`<p class=\"description\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><strong>Controller or keyboard required</strong></p><div class=\"menu\">${button('Settings','settings','','ghost')}</div>`:`<div class=\"menu\">${button('Begin your week','slots','','primary')}<div class=\"menu-row\">${button('Drop-in','dropin','','ghost')}${button('Family Hour','family','','ghost')}</div><div class=\"menu-row\">${button('Settings','settings','','ghost')}${button('About','about','','ghost')}</div></div>${footer()}`}`,'title-screen')+`<div class=\"hero-note\">WELCOME TO LITTLE ISLAND<strong>Take it one wobble at a time.</strong>EST. WHENEVER YOU ARE READY</div>`;\n36:    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('title')}<span class=\"badge sun\">✦ ${player.drips} DRIPS</span></div>${heading(`DAY ${day} / 7 · ${DAY_NAMES[day-1]}`,'Good to see you. ',`Ounce says: “${day===7?'Today, we stand together. And I owe you an explanation.':'The island is ready when you are.'}”`)}<div class=\"stats\"><span class=\"badge\">${escape(player.name)}</span> <span class=\"badge\">${player.stars} STARS</span> <span class=\"badge\">WOBBLE AGE ${player.history.length?wobbleAge(player):'—'}</span></div><div class=\"stack\"><button class=\"list-item\" data-action=\"weigh\"><span class=\"icon\">◉</span><span><span class=\"name\">Daily weigh-in</span><span class=\"sub\">THREE LITTLE BALANCE CHECKS</span></span><span class=\"arrow\">→</span></button>${day===7?`<button class=\"list-item\" data-action=\"finale\"><span class=\"icon\">✦</span><span><span class=\"name\">The Long Stand</span><span class=\"sub\">YOUR WEEK FINALE</span></span><span class=\"arrow\">→</span></button>`:''}</div><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">PICK A PRACTICE · ${activities.length} OPEN</div><div class=\"scroll-list stack\">${activities.map(activity=>`<button class=\"list-item\" data-action=\"intro\" data-id=\"${activity.id}\"><span class=\"icon\">${iconFor(activity.family)}</span><span><span class=\"name\">${escape(activity.name)}</span><span class=\"sub\">${escape(activity.place.toUpperCase())} · ${activity.duration} SEC ${player.played[activity.id]?`· ${'★'.repeat(player.played[activity.id])}`:''}</span></span><span class=\"arrow\">→</span></button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"menu-row\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">${button('Day report','day-report','','small')}${button('Settings','settings','','small ghost')}</div>${footer()}`,'island-screen');\n42:    content=`<section class=\"screen game-screen\"><div class=\"game-hud\"><div class=\"game-top\"><div class=\"game-title\"><small>${app.attract?'ISLAND DEMO · PRESS ANY KEY TO PLAY':app.hubRound?'AI HUB · THREE-EVENT MEDLEY':escape(activity.place.toUpperCase())}</small><strong>${escape(activity.name)}</strong></div><div class=\"game-time\" id=\"seconds\">${Math.ceil(app.session.duration)}</div></div><div class=\"game-bottom\"><div class=\"balance-card\"><div class=\"balance-inner\"><div class=\"dial\" id=\"dial\" aria-label=\"Balance indicator\"><div class=\"dial-ring\"></div><div class=\"dot\" id=\"balance-dot\"></div></div><div class=\"balance-text\"><strong>Find your center.</strong><p id=\"live-score\">A little wobble is normal.</p><div class=\"meter\"><span id=\"meter\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"game-tip\">${escape(activity.instruction)}<br><strong id=\"live-cue\"></strong><br><span class=\"key\">WASD / L</span> LEAN <span class=\"key\">SPACE / R2</span> BREATHE<br><span class=\"key\">F / J · L1 / R1</span> STEP · ESC PAUSE</div></div></div></section>`;\n55:  }else if(app.screen==='family'){\n56:    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('title')}<span class=\"badge\">LOCAL MULTIPLAYER</span></div>${heading('PASS THE CONTROLLER','Family Hour','One to four players take turns through a three-event medley. Highest total wins; kindness is mandatory.')}<div class=\"stack\">${[1,2,3,4].map(number=>button(`${number} ${number===1?'player':'players'}`,'family-start',`data-count=\"${number}\"`,number===2?'primary':'ghost')).join('')}</div>${footer()}`);\n67:  }else if(app.screen==='hub-card'){\n68:    content=panel(`${brand}${heading('AI HUB · GHOST MEDLEY','Ready to wobble?','Three events, one shared clock. Earn points and watch your fellow islanders as ghosts.')}<div class=\"menu\">${button('Ready','hub-ready','','primary')}${button('I need more time','hub-more','','ghost')}</div>${footer()}`);\n75:function go(screen){app.screen=screen;render();}\n76:function begin(activity,options={}){\n79:function finish(){\n83:  if(app.hubRound){advanceHub();return;}\n89:function startWeigh(){const index=app.weigh.length;const names=['Still water','A gentle shift','Chase the breeze'];begin({...ACTIVITIES[0],id:['tree','heron','tax'][index],name:names[index],place:'Weigh-in',duration:8,ring:.38,instruction:['KEEP YOUR DOT IN THE RING','COUNTER THE DRIFT','STAY NEAR THE CENTER'][index]});}\n90:function startMedley(){const sequence=['tree','hoop','step'];const id=sequence[app.medley.event];begin({...ACTIVITIES.find(activity=>activity.id===id),name:`PLAYER ${app.medley.player+1} · ${ACTIVITIES.find(activity=>activity.id===id).name}`},{duration:20});}\n91:function startAttract(){app.attract=true;const sequence=['tree','hoop','step','header','slackline'];const activity=ACTIVITIES.find(item=>item.id===sequence[app.attractIndex%sequence.length]);begin(activity,{duration:12});}\n92:function leaveAttract(){app.attract=false;app.session=null;app.lastInput=performance.now();go('title');}\n93:function act(action,element){\n109:  else if(action==='family')go('family');\n110:  else if(action==='family-start'){app.medley={scores:Array(Number(element.dataset.count)).fill(0),player:0,event:0};startMedley();}\n118:  else if(action==='hub-ready')globalThis.AIHub?.answer('ready');\n119:  else if(action==='hub-more')globalThis.AIHub?.answer('more');\n124:function menuMove(delta){const buttons=Array.from(ui.querySelectorAll('button:not(:disabled)'));if(!buttons.length)return;app.focus=(app.focus+delta+buttons.length)%buttons.length;buttons.forEach((item,index)=>item.classList.toggle('focused',index===app.focus));buttons[app.focus].focus();buttons[app.focus].scrollIntoView({block:'nearest'});}\n125:function pause(){if(app.screen==='game'&&!app.attract&&!app.hubRound){app.paused=true;go('pause');}else if(app.screen==='pause')act('resume');}\n126:window.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{const wasNotice=notice();app.keyboardSeen=true;app.lastInput=performance.now();app.inputKind='keyboard';sound.unlock();if(app.attract){leaveAttract();return;}if(app.screen==='title'&&wasNotice)render();const key=event.key.toLowerCase();if(['arrowup','arrowdown','arrowleft','arrowright',' ','escape'].includes(key))event.preventDefault();if(event.repeat)return;app.keys.add(key);if(app.screen==='game'){if(key==='f')app.input.left=true;if(key==='j')app.input.right=true;if(key==='escape')pause();}else if(!['INPUT','SELECT'].includes(document.activeElement?.tagName)){if(key==='arrowdown'||key==='s')menuMove(1);else if(key==='arrowup'||key==='w')menuMove(-1);else if(key==='enter'){event.preventDefault();const buttons=Array.from(ui.querySelectorAll('button:not(:disabled)'));buttons[app.focus]?.click();}else if(key==='escape'){const backButton=ui.querySelector('.back');if(backButton)backButton.click();else if(app.screen==='pause')pause();}}});\n127:window.addEventListener('keyup',event=>app.keys.delete(event.key.toLowerCase()));\n128:window.addEventListener('blur',()=>app.keys.clear());\n129:window.addEventListener('pointerdown',event=>{app.lastInput=performance.now();if(app.attract){leaveAttract();return;}sound.unlock();if(event.pointerType==='mouse')app.inputKind='mouse';});\n131:window.addEventListener('gamepadconnected',()=>{app.lastInput=performance.now();if(app.screen==='title')render();});\n133:function gamepad(){const pad=Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).find(Boolean);if(!pad)return null;const down=index=>!!pad.buttons[index]?.pressed;const just=index=>down(index)&&!app.gamepadButtons[index];if(just(9)){app.lastInput=performance.now();app.inputKind='gamepad';pause();}if(app.screen!=='game'){if(just(12))menuMove(-1);if(just(13))menuMove(1);if(just(0)){const buttons=Array.from(ui.querySelectorAll('button:not(:disabled)'));buttons[app.focus]?.click();}if(just(1))ui.querySelector('.back')?.click();}else{if(just(4))app.input.left=true;if(just(5))app.input.right=true;}if(pad.axes.some(value=>Math.abs(value)>.2)||pad.buttons.some(item=>item.pressed)){app.lastInput=performance.now();app.inputKind='gamepad';if(app.attract){leaveAttract();return null;}}app.gamepadButtons=pad.buttons.map(item=>item.pressed);return pad;}\n134:function activityCue(session){\n136:  if(activity.family==='reps'){\n141:  if(activity.family==='header')return Math.floor(time/2.4)%2===0?'← HEAD LEFT':'HEAD RIGHT →';\n142:  if(activity.family==='step')return Math.abs(time/.7-Math.round(time/.7))<.23?'STEP NOW · F OR J':'WAIT FOR THE BEAT';\n143:  if(activity.family==='jog')return 'ALTERNATE F AND J';\n144:  if(activity.family==='slack')return 'F / J TO WALK THE LINE';\n145:  if(activity.family==='jump')return 'SPACE / R2 TO JUMP';\n146:  if(activity.family==='hoop')return `CIRCLE THE STICK · ${Math.round(session.hoopLift*100)}% LIFT`;\n150:function frame(now){\n152:  if(app.hubClosed){requestAnimationFrame(frame);return;}\n157:    if(app.hubRound&&globalThis.AIHub.time()<0){if(seconds)seconds.textContent=`${Math.ceil(-globalThis.AIHub.time()/1000)}`;app.input.left=false;app.input.right=false;requestAnimationFrame(frame);return;}\n161:    if(app.attract){const time=app.session.elapsed;x=app.session.activity.family==='hoop'?Math.cos(time*7):Math.sin(time*1.2)*.2;y=app.session.activity.family==='hoop'?Math.sin(time*7):Math.cos(time)*.2;if(Math.floor(time*3)%2===0)app.input.left=true;else app.input.right=true;}\n164:    const dot=document.getElementById('balance-dot'),meter=document.getElementById('meter'),score=document.getElementById('live-score'),cue=document.getElementById('live-cue'),dial=document.getElementById('dial');\n170:    if(dial&&app.hubRound){dial.querySelectorAll('.ghost-dot').forEach(node=>node.remove());for(const ghost of Object.values(app.hubScores).slice(0,3)){if(!Number.isFinite(ghost?.x)||!Number.isFinite(ghost?.y))continue;const marker=document.createElement('span');marker.className='ghost-dot';marker.style.left=`${50+Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,ghost.x))*38}%`;marker.style.top=`${50+Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,ghost.y))*38}%`;dial.appendChild(marker);}}\n171:    if(app.hubRound&&now-app.hubClock>500){app.hubClock=now;const partial=app.hubTotal+app.session.result().score;globalThis.AIHub?.progress({score:partial,label:app.activity.name});globalThis.AIHub?.send({x:app.session.dot.x,y:app.session.dot.y,score:partial});}\n177:function advanceHub(){if(app.hubEnded)return;app.hubTotal+=app.session.result().score;app.hubEvent++;if(app.hubEvent>=3){app.hubEnded=true;globalThis.AIHub?.result({score:app.hubTotal});app.result={...app.session.result(),score:app.hubTotal,stars:0,drips:0};app.hubRound=false;go('results');}else begin({...ACTIVITIES.find(item=>item.id===['tree','hoop','step'][app.hubEvent])},{duration:20});}\n178:function setupHub(){const hub=globalThis.AIHub;if(!hub?.active)return;hub.on('card',()=>{app.hubClosed=false;go('hub-card');});hub.on('start',()=>{app.hubClosed=false;app.hubRound=true;app.hubEnded=false;app.hubScores={};app.hubEvent=0;app.hubTotal=0;begin({...ACTIVITIES[0]},{duration:20});});hub.on('message',(data,from)=>{app.hubScores[from]=data;});hub.on('time-up',()=>{if(app.hubRound&&!app.hubEnded){const result=app.hubTotal+(app.session?.result().score||0);app.hubEnded=true;hub.result({score:result});app.result={...app.session.result(),score:result,stars:0,drips:0};app.hubRound=false;go('results');}});hub.on('end',()=>{app.hubRound=false;app.hubEnded=true;app.hubClosed=true;sound.context?.suspend();});hub.connect({mode:'ghost',seats:[1,4],card:true});hub.ready();}\n179:window.__GAME__={go:(screen,args={})=>{if(args.id)app.activity=ACTIVITIES.find(item=>item.id===args.id);if(screen==='game'&&app.activity)begin(app.activity);else go(screen);},state:()=>({screen:app.screen,day:profile()?.day,activity:app.activity?.id,elapsed:app.session?.elapsed,score:app.session?.result().score,attract:app.attract,profiles:app.profiles,hubScores:app.hubScores}),setDriver:skill=>{app.driver=skill;},get tunables(){return app.tuning;},finishActivity:()=>{if(app.session){app.session.elapsed=app.session.duration;app.session.finished=true;finish();}}};\n\n--- SESSION ---\nimport { Dot, DEFAULT_TUNABLES } from './dot.js';\n\nconst clamp=(value,low,high)=>Math.max(low,Math.min(high,value));\nexport function makeProfile(name='PLAYER') {return {name,day:1,drips:0,stars:0,history:[],played:{},goal:'FIND YOUR BALANCE',revealed:false,completedDays:[]};}\nexport function wobbleAge(profile) {\n  const scores=profile.history.slice(-3);\n  const average=scores.length?scores.reduce((sum,value)=>sum+value,0)/scores.length:.5;\n  return clamp(Math.round(20+60*(1-average)-Math.min(20,profile.stars*.5)),18,95)+(profile.revealed?0:7);\n}\nexport class ActivitySession {\n  constructor(activity,options={}) {\n    this.activity=activity; this.hard=!!options.hard; this.duration=options.duration??activity.duration;\n    this.dot=new Dot(options.random); this.elapsed=0; this.points=0; this.samples=0; this.breathSync=.5;\n    this.rep=.0; this.hoopLift=.65; this.lastAngle=null; this.angleSpeed=0; this.goodSteps=0; this.lastStep=-2; this.hits=0;\n    this.tuning={...DEFAULT_TUNABLES,...options.tuning}; this.finished=false; this.distance=0; this.lastDirection=0;\n    this.eventCount=0; this.lastBeat=-1; this.notes=[];\n  }\n  update(dt,input={}) {\n    if(this.finished)return;\n    dt=clamp(dt*(this.tuning.timeScale??1),0,.1); this.elapsed+=dt;\n    const {x=0,y=0,breath=false,left=false,right=false}=input;\n    const family=this.activity.family, t=this.elapsed;\n    const breathIn=this.activity.breath?Math.sin(t*Math.PI*2/this.activity.breath)>0:false;\n    if(this.activity.breath) this.breathSync+=(Number(breath===breathIn)-this.breathSync)*Math.min(1,dt*2);\n    const modifiers={noise:this.activity.breath?1.25-.55*this.breathSync:1};\n    if(this.activity.id==='heron')modifiers.bx=.12*Math.sin(t*.7);\n    if(this.activity.id==='tax')modifiers.bx=.18*Math.sin(t*.9);\n    if(this.activity.id==='chair')modifiers.noise*=1+.5*t/this.duration;\n    if(this.activity.id==='plank')modifiers.inst=1.2;\n    this.dot.step(dt,x,y,this.tuning,modifiers);\n    const distance=Math.hypot(this.dot.x,this.dot.y);\n    let quality=0;\n    if(family==='still'||family==='tray'||family==='slack'||family==='jump'){\n      const ring=(this.activity.ring??(family==='slack'?.32:.48))*(this.hard?.8:1);\n      quality=distance<ring?1:0;\n      if(this.activity.breath)quality=.8*quality+.2*this.breathSync;\n      if(family==='slack'){\n        if((left||right)&&t-this.lastStep>.14){this.lastStep=t;this.goodSteps++;this.distance+=distance<.75?1:.15;}\n        quality*=.45+.55*clamp(this.goodSteps/(t*1.5),0,1);\n      }\n      if(family==='jump'&&breath&&t-this.lastStep>2){this.lastStep=t;this.goodSteps++;this.distance+=distance<.6?1:0;}\n      if(family==='jump') quality*=.5+.5*clamp(this.goodSteps/Math.max(1,t/5),0,1);\n    } else if(family==='reps'){\n      const phase=(t/3.2)%1;\n      const target=phase<.4?phase/.4:phase<.55?1:phase<.9?1-(phase-.55)/.35:0;\n      const requested=this.activity.id==='lunges'?Math.abs(x):this.activity.id==='mortgage'?Math.max(0,y):Math.max(0,-y);\n      this.rep+=(requested-this.rep)*Math.min(1,dt/((this.activity.id==='mortgage'?.15:.10)));\n      quality=clamp(1-1.6*Math.abs(this.rep-target),0,1);\n    } else if(family==='hoop'){\n      const magnitude=Math.hypot(x,y);\n      if(magnitude>.5){const angle=Math.atan2(y,x);if(this.lastAngle!==null){let delta=angle-this.lastAngle;while(delta>Math.PI)delta-=Math.PI*2;while(delta< -Math.PI)delta+=Math.PI*2;this.angleSpeed+=(Math.abs(delta)/Math.max(dt,.001)-this.angleSpeed)*Math.min(1,dt/.25);}this.lastAngle=angle;}else{this.angleSpeed*=Math.max(0,1-dt*3);this.lastAngle=null;}\n      const inBand=this.angleSpeed>4.5&&this.angleSpeed<18;\n      this.hoopLift=clamp(this.hoopLift+(inBand?.35:-.15)*dt,0,1);quality=this.hoopLift;\n    } else if(family==='step'||family==='jog'){\n      const beat=Math.floor(t/.7);\n      if(beat!==this.lastBeat){this.lastBeat=beat;this.eventCount++;}\n      if((left||right)&&t-this.lastStep>.12){const side=left?-1:1;const phase=Math.abs((t/.7)-Math.round(t/.7));if(family==='jog'?side!==this.lastDirection:phase<.23){this.goodSteps++;}this.lastDirection=side;this.lastStep=t;}\n      quality=clamp(this.goodSteps/Math.max(1,this.eventCount-1),0,1);\n    } else if(family==='header'){\n      const beat=Math.floor((t-1.2)/2.4);\n      if(beat>=0&&beat!==this.lastBeat){this.lastBeat=beat;this.eventCount++;const target=beat%2===0?-1:1;if(Math.sign(x)===target)this.hits++;}\n      quality=this.hits/Math.max(1,this.eventCount);\n    }\n    this.points+=quality*dt;this.samples+=dt;\n    if(this.elapsed>=this.duration)this.finished=true;\n  }\n  result(){const score=Math.round(100*this.points/Math.max(.001,this.samples));const thresholds=this.activity.family==='reps'?[55,75,90]:[45,70,90];const stars=thresholds.filter(value=>score>=value).length;return {score,stars,drips:2+stars*3+Math.floor(this.duration/30),seconds:this.duration};}\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_326","type":"reasoning","text":"**Opening untruncated source sections**"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_327","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '552,603p' PLAN.md; sed -n '856,915p' PLAN.md; printf '\\\\n--- HUB TEST ---\\\\n'; rg -n -C 4 'Test it|harness|AIHub.connect|card:' 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/vendor/hub/README.md'; printf '\\\\n--- SOURCES ---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,220p' 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/src/main.js'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_327","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '552,603p' PLAN.md; sed -n '856,915p' PLAN.md; printf '\\\\n--- HUB TEST ---\\\\n'; rg -n -C 4 'Test it|harness|AIHub.connect|card:' 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/vendor/hub/README.md'; printf '\\\\n--- SOURCES ---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,220p' 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/src/main.js'\"","aggregated_output":"## 12. Multiplayer\n\n**Reading of the brief:** the hub protocol is how the game plays online; on its own the game has no server, so it plays alone or on one screen. Both run the same round, **The Medley**, and the same lane code. Nothing else connects to a network.\n\n### The Medley\n\nThree events in fixed windows: Stillness (a pose), then Beat (Reps or Hoop or Step), then Balance-lean (Header), each 55 s with 10 s between, about 3.2 minutes. The specific picks and shortened durations live in `src/data/medley.js`, and the picks come from a seeded stream. Each event normalises to 0-1000; the total wins. Results show medals, awards (\"Stillest\", \"Most Apologetic\") and Ounce's remarks.\n\n### On its own: Family Hour\n\nJoin screen: **each device claims a mat by pressing Cross/Enter** (up to 4 pads plus keyboard-and-mouse). Bots can fill empty mats (toggle).\n\n**The engine merges all pads into one** ✔, so lanes read `navigator.getGamepads()` by index themselves (`applyDeadzone` is exported; guard for Node). In 4-mat staging, each player gets a small dial (radius 24) above their avatar's head. Podium, rematch.\n\n### In AI Hub: ghost mode\n\nPassed 16/16 with the real engine on WebGPU ✔ at players=1, 2, 4 (latency, jitter, loss) and host-leave.\n\n```html\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<script>/* session.js pasted unmodified: first script, right after charset */</script>\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"ghost\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Score the most across three events. Stay in the circle.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Left stick, WASD or mouse: lean. R2, Space or click: breathe. L1/R1, F/J: step.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:webgpu\" content=\"required\">\n```\n\nBoot order ✔:\n\n```js\nlet info = null;\nif (window.AIHub?.active) info = await AIHub.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true });\nconst engine = await Engine.start(firstScene, withUrlOptions({ /* ... */ seed: info ? info.seed : savedOrDefaultSeed }));\nif (info) AIHub.ready();                 // no key press, as soon as the card can show\n```\n\nIf `connect()` answers null, carry on as the normal game. Without WebGPU, `Engine.start` rejects and the engine prints \"Failed to start: WebGPU unavailable: ...\" on the page ✔. Catch the rejection, or it also surfaces as a page error ✔, and call `AIHub.fail(message)` in a session.\n\n**In a session:**\n- **The card (`card: true`)** is the game's own: the players' avatars lining up on mats in seat colours (`#e8443a #3b82f6 #22c55e #f5b700`), {TITLE}, ready ticks, how to win, the controls for the last device, the time left from the `card` event. Enter or Cross → `AIHub.answer('ready')`; Triangle or M → `AIHub.answer('more')`. Use a **direct `keydown` listener for Enter** ✔ here. No menus. Cosmetic randomness only from `AIHub.rng('card')`.\n- **Start:** on `start` show a countdown from `AIHub.time()`; play at `time() >= 0`. Event windows are read from `AIHub.time()`, so all copies stay in step.\n- **Same world:** gusts, pose picks and object waves come from `AIHub.rng(label)` or the seeded `ctx.random`.\n- **Ghosts:** a `setInterval` at 100 ms (not tied to rendering) sends `AIHub.send({ a: eventIndex, x, y, c: clipIndex, t: clipTime, s: score }, { reliable: false })` and calls `AIHub.progress({ score, label })`. Start as soon as `start` arrives, even with score 0: the harness needs both within seconds. Receivers lerp the other mats; they never simulate them, and they hide a ghost whose `a` differs from theirs.\n- **`leave`:** that avatar waves and walks off. The round goes on, host included.\n- **End:** `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })` once, at the end of the Medley or at once on `time-up`. On `end`: stop input, stop sound, send nothing.\n- **Never:** no title, attract, dev mode, saves, quit or restart; no chat or custom names; no `alert`, `window.open` or navigation. Names come from `info.players` and are drawn with `say()`.\n\n---\n\n### Hub harness ✔\n\nCopy the built html (as `game.html`) with `harness.html`, `bridge.js` and `round.js` into a temp folder inside the dev folder. Serve it with `python3 -u -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1` ✔, reading the port from its first output line and stopping it by its PID. An in-process `node:http` server on `127.0.0.1` and port 0 also works, but it must send `Content-Type: text/javascript` for `.js`, or the harness's module imports fail. Then for each of:\n\n```\nharness.html?game=game.html&auto=1&players=1\nharness.html?game=game.html&auto=1&players=2\nharness.html?game=game.html&auto=1&players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5\nharness.html?game=game.html&auto=1&players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave\n```\n\nwait for `document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'`, then require `window.__hubCheck.pass`; print failed checks' `name` and `detail`. Each took 10-13 s with a light scene. Keep the card scene light so `ready()` lands inside the 20 s limit even with 4 software-rendered copies. Confirm the served page is yours (its title) before trusting a result. Then open the game outside a session and check it still runs.\n\n### Headless facts ✔\n\n- 600 frames with mixers takes about 80 ms, and boot about 240 ms, so full playthroughs are cheap.\n- `Engine.headless(game, { camera })`: built-ins load with no asset reader.\n- `recording()` and `replay()` reproduce the fingerprint across `loadGame`.\n- `input.setPointer(x, y, true)` drives the mouse.\n- `ctx.audio` counts plays with no context.\n\n---\n\n## 18. Testing\n\n**One command: `node tools/test.mjs`** prints only failures and one count line (`212/212 passed`). `--fast` runs the Node tests only. Rerun only after changing what a test covers. Prefer scripts to screenshots. Don't use subagents or workflows to review, judge or audit. Keep at most two browsers open.\n\n**Headless (Node), seconds:**\n\n1. **Dot:** idle bot < 20% at ring .30; average 35-65%; good > 80%; expert > 95%.\n2. **Clips:** `validateClip` empty and `analyzeClip(...).problems` empty for every clip you wrote.\n3. **Data:** every model (`checkModel`) and texture (`validateTexture`) clean; all ids resolve; `parseSong` on every song; each song passes the level check in §15; every line fits its box; every character of every string has a glyph.\n4. **Every activity:** idle bot finishes with 0★ and no error; expert bot ≥ 2★ (≥ 3★ on easy ones); sloppy < expert; result written; Drips correct.\n5. **Full scripted playthrough:** drive the real menus with `setKey` from a fresh save, bots inside activities: new week → all 7 days → every station → goals → unlock schedule → Jar milestones → Long Stand → confession subtracts exactly 7 → credits → Week 2. Assert the state at each step.\n6. **Save:** reload mid-week restores; corrupt JSON falls back safely; no storage works.\n7. **Pause:** `timeScale` 0, `fixedUpdate` frozen, menu navigable, resume exact.\n8. **Dev:** every slider changes live behaviour; reset restores defaults; every tool works.\n9. **Attract:** 10 s idle on title and on a menu starts it; no trigger during play; a full loop runs error-free over all items; any input exits.\n10. **Determinism:** record an activity, replay it, fingerprints equal.\n11. **Medley:** 4 bot lanes, scores in range, windows respected; a ghost lane never simulates.\n12. **Voice:** `syllabify` is stable, the same word gives the same syllables, a question rises.\n13. **Engine untouched:** `pixel-engine.js` hash equals the kit's.\n\n**Browser, on the built html via `file://`:**\n\n14. Boots on WebGPU with no errors; title visible; **music volume is exactly 0.10** on first run.\n15. Pad stub: ✕ confirms; prompts show PlayStation glyphs; the Settings option gives Xbox; a key press switches to keycaps; mouse move switches to mouse prompts; hover moves focus; click activates. Record each prompt state in `App.state()` so no picture is needed.\n16. Phone profile with touch: message showing, ⚙ present, `engine.touch` null, attract runs.\n17. Family Hour with 2 stub pads plus keyboard: three lanes move independently.\n18. Audio after a real click: an `AnalyserNode` on the destination reads non-silent for SFX and music; voice in `OfflineAudioContext` has RMS > .02, and Ounce's mean pitch exceeds Coach's.\n19. No layout overflow at 1920×1080, 1280×720 and 640×360: widgets record their rects, and the test asserts all fit.\n20. WebKit (iPhone profile) and Firefox have no `navigator.gpu` on this machine ✔, so they can only test failure: the engine's \"Failed to start: WebGPU unavailable\" message shows ✔ and no page error is thrown. Test the touch-only screen itself in Chromium's phone profile, as in test 16.\n\n**Hub:**\n\n21. The four harness runs from section 17, all `pass`. Each harness frame is a separate copy of the game, which covers the brief's \"no second player\" note.\n22. Outside a session: normal boot with `AIHub.active` false.\n\n---\n\n\n--- HUB TEST ---\n8-\n9-**https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/README.md**\n10-\n11-The hub tests every game when it joins the library, with the same test\n12:described in *Test it*, and keeps a game that fails it out of sessions.\n13-\n14-- Client: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/session.js\n15:- Harness: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/harness.html\n16-\n17-To ask an agent for it, add this to the game's prompt:\n18-\n19-> This game must support AI Hub sessions. Follow\n20-> https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/README.md\n21:> (AI Hub Session Protocol v1) and pass the harness's automatic check.\n22-\n23----\n24-\n25-## Modes\n--\n48-\n49-## A round\n50-\n51-1. The hub loads the game on every player's device, and the players get 10\n52:   to 30 seconds with the game's card: what the game is, how to win, the\n53-   controls. The card is the hub's, from the game's tags, or the game's own\n54-   (*The card*).\n55-2. The game connects and calls `ready()`.\n56-3. The round starts on the hub's clock, on every device at once.\n--\n107-\n108-- `AIHub.active` is `true` from the first line when the hub opened the page.\n109-- In a session, the game opens straight into the round: no title screen,\n110-  menus or prompts before it, other than its own card (*The card*).\n111:- `AIHub.connect({ mode, seats: [min, max] })` returns a promise of the\n112-  round's `info`, or of `null` when there is no hub after all; with `null`\n113-  the game runs as it does on its own.\n114-- `AIHub.ready()` is called once, when the game has loaded and the round can\n115-  start, with no key press: the players answer the card.\n--\n137-next and say when they are ready. By default the hub shows its own card over\n138-the game. A game can make the card its own, as part of the game:\n139-\n140-```js\n141:AIHub.connect({ mode, seats, card: true });\n142-```\n143-\n144-The hub's card then steps aside when the game calls `ready()`, and the game's\n145-screen is the card until `start`. How it looks and sounds is the game's: its\n--\n154-- the controls this player will use;\n155-- the time left, from the `card` event.\n156-\n157-And it takes two answers, from the keyboard, a controller, or a tap or click\n158:on the card:\n159-\n160-- **Ready**: Enter, Cross (button 0), or a tap on Ready:\n161-  `AIHub.answer('ready')`.\n162-- **More time**: Triangle (button 3), a key the card names, or a tap on More\n--\n310-one, the game is not affected.\n311-\n312----\n313-\n314:## Test it\n315-\n316:The harness plays the hub: it loads the game 1–4 times on a simulated network\n317-and runs the checks the hub runs when a game joins the library. Serve it next\n318-to the game:\n319-\n320-```bash\n321:curl -fsSO https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/harness.html\n322-curl -fsSO https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/bridge.js\n323-curl -fsSO https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/round.js\n324-python3 -m http.server 8000\n325-```\n326-\n327:Then open `http://localhost:8000/harness.html?game=GAME.html&players=2&auto=1`.\n328-The hub's own test also runs ghost and shared-world games with\n329-`&players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1`, again with\n330-`&scenario=host-leave`, and shared worlds once more with\n331-`&players=2&scenario=server`.\n--\n346-\n347-**New round**, **Time up**, **Remove player** and **Hide host tab** run the\n348-cases by hand; clicking a player's frame gives it the keyboard and mouse.\n349-`&limit=` sets the round's length in seconds and `&seed=` fixes the seed. The\n350:game is served from the harness's own origin.\n351-\n352-In the AI Hub repository, `node scripts/hub-check.mjs <game>` runs the same\n353-checks with Playwright, then opens the game outside a session to see it still\n354-runs there.\n--\n373-\n374-| | |\n375-|---|---|\n376-| `AIHub.active` | `true` in a session, from the first line |\n377:| `AIHub.connect({ mode, seats, card? })` | → `Promise<info \\| null>`; `null`: no hub. `card: true`: the game shows its own card |\n378-| `AIHub.ready()` | once, when the round can start |\n379-| `AIHub.answer('ready' \\| 'more')` | on the game's own card, before `start` |\n380-| `AIHub.time()` | milliseconds since play began: negative in the countdown, `-Infinity` before `start` |\n381-| `AIHub.on(event, fn)` | returns a function that removes the handler |\n\n--- SOURCES ---\nimport { ACTIVITIES, DAY_NAMES, activityForDay } from './data/activities.js';\nimport { makeProfile, wobbleAge, ActivitySession } from './core/session.js';\nimport { DEFAULT_TUNABLES } from './core/dot.js';\nimport { Sound } from './core/audio-runtime.js';\nimport { about } from './data/about.js';\nimport { TITLE } from './data/title.js';\nimport { startWorld } from './world.js';\n\nconst ui=document.getElementById('ui');\nconst stored=(key,fallback)=>{try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key))??fallback;}catch{return fallback;}};\nconst escape=value=>String(value).replace(/[&<>\"']/g,character=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[character]));\nconst app={screen:'title',session:null,settings:{music:.1,effects:.7,glyphs:'ps',contrast:false,motion:false,...stored('alob-settings',{})},profiles:stored('alob-profiles',[null,null,null]),slot:0,activity:null,result:null,tuning:{...DEFAULT_TUNABLES},input:{x:0,y:0,breath:false,left:false,right:false},keys:new Set(),lastInput:performance.now(),inputKind:'keyboard',focus:0,paused:false,attract:false,attractIndex:0,medley:null,weigh:null,hubRound:false,hubEnded:false,hubScores:{},hubClock:0,gamepadButtons:[],driver:null};\nconst sound=new Sound(app.settings);\nconst save=()=>{try{localStorage.setItem('alob-profiles',JSON.stringify(app.profiles));localStorage.setItem('alob-settings',JSON.stringify(app.settings));}catch{}};\nconst profile=()=>app.guest||app.profiles[app.slot];\nconst brand='<div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"brand-icon\">✳</span> LITTLE ISLAND WELLNESS</div>';\nconst button=(label,action,extra='',style='')=>`<button class=\"button ${style}\" data-action=\"${action}\" ${extra}>${label}<span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button>`;\nconst back=target=>`<button class=\"back\" data-action=\"${target}\" aria-label=\"Go back\">←</button>`;\nconst panel=(content,extra='')=>`<section class=\"screen ${extra}\"><div class=\"panel glass\">${content}</div></section>`;\nconst heading=(kicker,title,description)=>`<div class=\"eyebrow\">${kicker}</div><h1 class=\"heading\">${title}</h1><p class=\"description\">${description}</p>`;\nconst hint=()=>app.inputKind==='gamepad'?`<span class=\"key\">${app.settings.glyphs==='xbox'?'A':'✕'}</span> SELECT <span class=\"key\">${app.settings.glyphs==='xbox'?'B':'◯'}</span> BACK`:'<span class=\"key\">↑↓</span> CHOOSE <span class=\"key\">ENTER</span> SELECT';\nconst footer=()=>`<div class=\"footnote\">${hint()}</div>`;\nconst notice=()=>matchMedia('(hover: none) and (pointer: coarse)').matches&&!app.keyboardSeen&&!Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).some(Boolean);\nconst iconFor=family=>({still:'✳',reps:'↕',hoop:'◌',header:'◉',step:'♪',slack:'〰',tray:'♧',jog:'➜',jump:'↗'})[family]||'✳';\n\nfunction render(){\n  document.body.classList.toggle('high-contrast',app.settings.contrast);\n  document.body.classList.toggle('reduce-motion',app.settings.motion);\n  let content='';\n  if(app.screen==='title'){\n    content=panel(`${brand}<h1 class=\"title\">${escape(TITLE.split(' ').slice(0,2).join(' '))}<br><span>${escape(TITLE.split(' ').slice(2).join(' '))}.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">A week of movement, a talking scale, and absolutely no pressure to be graceful.</p><div class=\"title-tag\">YOUR ISLAND IS READY</div>${notice()?`<p class=\"description\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><strong>Controller or keyboard required</strong></p><div class=\"menu\">${button('Settings','settings','','ghost')}</div>`:`<div class=\"menu\">${button('Begin your week','slots','','primary')}<div class=\"menu-row\">${button('Drop-in','dropin','','ghost')}${button('Family Hour','family','','ghost')}</div><div class=\"menu-row\">${button('Settings','settings','','ghost')}${button('About','about','','ghost')}</div></div>${footer()}`}`,'title-screen')+`<div class=\"hero-note\">WELCOME TO LITTLE ISLAND<strong>Take it one wobble at a time.</strong>EST. WHENEVER YOU ARE READY</div>`;\n  }else if(app.screen==='slots'){\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('title')}<span class=\"badge\">YOUR WEEK</span></div>${heading('A PLACE TO BEGIN','Who is stepping on?','Choose a profile. Your island remembers your progress on this device.')}<div class=\"stack\">${app.profiles.map((item,index)=>`<button class=\"list-item\" data-action=\"slot\" data-index=\"${index}\"><span class=\"icon\">${index+1}</span><span><span class=\"name\">${item?escape(item.name):'Start a new week'}</span><span class=\"sub\">${item?`DAY ${item.day} · ${item.drips} DRIPS`:'EMPTY PROFILE'}</span></span><span class=\"arrow\">→</span></button>`).join('')}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='island'){\n    const player=profile(), day=Math.min(player.day,7), activities=activityForDay(day);\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('title')}<span class=\"badge sun\">✦ ${player.drips} DRIPS</span></div>${heading(`DAY ${day} / 7 · ${DAY_NAMES[day-1]}`,'Good to see you. ',`Ounce says: “${day===7?'Today, we stand together. And I owe you an explanation.':'The island is ready when you are.'}”`)}<div class=\"stats\"><span class=\"badge\">${escape(player.name)}</span> <span class=\"badge\">${player.stars} STARS</span> <span class=\"badge\">WOBBLE AGE ${player.history.length?wobbleAge(player):'—'}</span></div><div class=\"stack\"><button class=\"list-item\" data-action=\"weigh\"><span class=\"icon\">◉</span><span><span class=\"name\">Daily weigh-in</span><span class=\"sub\">THREE LITTLE BALANCE CHECKS</span></span><span class=\"arrow\">→</span></button>${day===7?`<button class=\"list-item\" data-action=\"finale\"><span class=\"icon\">✦</span><span><span class=\"name\">The Long Stand</span><span class=\"sub\">YOUR WEEK FINALE</span></span><span class=\"arrow\">→</span></button>`:''}</div><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">PICK A PRACTICE · ${activities.length} OPEN</div><div class=\"scroll-list stack\">${activities.map(activity=>`<button class=\"list-item\" data-action=\"intro\" data-id=\"${activity.id}\"><span class=\"icon\">${iconFor(activity.family)}</span><span><span class=\"name\">${escape(activity.name)}</span><span class=\"sub\">${escape(activity.place.toUpperCase())} · ${activity.duration} SEC ${player.played[activity.id]?`· ${'★'.repeat(player.played[activity.id])}`:''}</span></span><span class=\"arrow\">→</span></button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"menu-row\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">${button('Day report','day-report','','small')}${button('Settings','settings','','small ghost')}</div>${footer()}`,'island-screen');\n  }else if(app.screen==='intro'){\n    const activity=app.activity;\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back(app.returnScreen||'island')}<span class=\"badge sun\">${escape(activity.place.toUpperCase())}</span></div>${heading('TODAY’S PRACTICE',escape(activity.name),escape(activity.instruction)+'.')}<div class=\"instruction-card\"><strong>LET’S KEEP IT SIMPLE</strong><p>Lean with the left stick or WASD. Press Space / R2 to breathe; use F and J / L1 and R1 to step.</p><p>Find your own rhythm. Ounce is not a medical professional, despite the nametag.</p></div><div class=\"menu\">${button('Let’s go','start','','primary')}${button(`Hard mode: ${app.hard?'ON':'OFF'}`,'hard','','ghost')}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='game'){\n    const activity=app.session.activity;\n    content=`<section class=\"screen game-screen\"><div class=\"game-hud\"><div class=\"game-top\"><div class=\"game-title\"><small>${app.attract?'ISLAND DEMO · PRESS ANY KEY TO PLAY':app.hubRound?'AI HUB · THREE-EVENT MEDLEY':escape(activity.place.toUpperCase())}</small><strong>${escape(activity.name)}</strong></div><div class=\"game-time\" id=\"seconds\">${Math.ceil(app.session.duration)}</div></div><div class=\"game-bottom\"><div class=\"balance-card\"><div class=\"balance-inner\"><div class=\"dial\" id=\"dial\" aria-label=\"Balance indicator\"><div class=\"dial-ring\"></div><div class=\"dot\" id=\"balance-dot\"></div></div><div class=\"balance-text\"><strong>Find your center.</strong><p id=\"live-score\">A little wobble is normal.</p><div class=\"meter\"><span id=\"meter\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"game-tip\">${escape(activity.instruction)}<br><strong id=\"live-cue\"></strong><br><span class=\"key\">WASD / L</span> LEAN <span class=\"key\">SPACE / R2</span> BREATHE<br><span class=\"key\">F / J · L1 / R1</span> STEP · ESC PAUSE</div></div></div></section>`;\n  }else if(app.screen==='pause'){\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\"><span class=\"badge\">TAKE YOUR TIME</span></div>${heading('PAUSED','A little breather.','Your island will be right here.')}<div class=\"menu\">${button('Resume','resume','','primary')}${button('Settings','settings','','ghost')}${button('Dev tools','dev','','ghost')}${button('Leave practice','leave','','ghost')}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='results'){\n    const result=app.result;\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\"><span class=\"badge sun\">PRACTICE COMPLETE</span></div>${heading('NICE WORK',escape(app.activity.name),escape(app.activity.quip||'THE ISLAND IS PROUD OF YOU.'))}<div class=\"score-hero\">${result.score}<small style=\"font-size:20px;color:#8ca397\"> / 100</small></div><div class=\"stars\">${'★'.repeat(result.stars)}${'☆'.repeat(3-result.stars)}</div><div class=\"result-box\"><span>+ ${result.drips} DRIPS</span><span>${Math.round(result.seconds)} SECONDS OF YOU TIME</span></div><div class=\"menu\">${button(app.medley?'Next player / event':app.weigh?'Continue weigh-in':'Back to the island','continue','','primary')}${!app.medley&&!app.weigh?button('Try again','start','','ghost'):''}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='weigh-result'){\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\"><span class=\"badge\">DAILY CHECK-IN</span></div>${heading('A NUMBER, NOT A VERDICT','Your wobble age','Ounce has reviewed your three balance checks with tremendous confidence.')}<div class=\"score-hero\">${wobbleAge(profile())}</div><p class=\"description\">This is just a playful score, not a measure of health. Keep moving at your own pace.</p><div class=\"menu\">${button('Back to the island','island','','primary')}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='day-report'){\n    const player=profile();\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('island')}<span class=\"badge sun\">DAY ${player.day}</span></div>${heading('YOUR DAY REPORT','Every wobble counts.',`You have collected ${player.drips} drips and ${player.stars} stars. You showed up; the rest is gravy.`)}<div class=\"instruction-card\"><strong>OUNCE’S NOTE</strong><p>${player.day===6?'Tomorrow is the Long Stand. Ounce seems unusually quiet.':player.day>=7?'The island is still yours to enjoy.':'A little movement is better than a perfectly planned nap. Usually.'}</p></div><div class=\"menu\">${button(player.day>=7?'Back to the island':'Start the next day','next-day','','primary')}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='reveal'){\n    content=panel(`${brand}${heading('THE LONG STAND','Ounce comes clean.','“I added seven years to everyone’s wobble age. I thought you would come back if the number worried you. That was wrong.”')}<p class=\"description\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">The island agrees: a number should never tell you your worth. Your wobble age is now honest, and the island remains open.</p><div class=\"menu\">${button('A fresh start','island','','primary')}</div>`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='family'){\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('title')}<span class=\"badge\">LOCAL MULTIPLAYER</span></div>${heading('PASS THE CONTROLLER','Family Hour','One to four players take turns through a three-event medley. Highest total wins; kindness is mandatory.')}<div class=\"stack\">${[1,2,3,4].map(number=>button(`${number} ${number===1?'player':'players'}`,'family-start',`data-count=\"${number}\"`,number===2?'primary':'ghost')).join('')}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='medley-board'){\n    const ranking=app.medley.scores.map((score,index)=>({score,index})).sort((left,right)=>right.score-left.score);\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\"><span class=\"badge sun\">FAMILY HOUR</span></div>${heading('MEDLEY COMPLETE','A standing ovation.','Every player gets a turn in the spotlight.')}<div class=\"stack\">${ranking.map((entry,index)=>`<div class=\"list-item\"><span class=\"icon\">${index+1}</span><span><span class=\"name\">PLAYER ${entry.index+1}</span><span class=\"sub\">${entry.score} POINTS</span></span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"menu\">${button('Back to title','title','','primary')}</div>`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='settings'||app.screen==='dev'){\n    const dev=app.screen==='dev';\n    const ranges=dev?Object.entries(app.tuning).map(([key,value])=>`<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"${key}\">${escape(key)}</label><input id=\"${key}\" data-tune=\"${key}\" type=\"range\" min=\"${key==='timeScale'?.25:0}\" max=\"${key==='timeScale'?4:key==='dotLag'?.5:8}\" step=\".01\" value=\"${value}\"></div>`).join(''):`<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"music\">Music ${Math.round(app.settings.music*100)}%</label><input id=\"music\" data-setting=\"music\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\".05\" value=\"${app.settings.music}\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"effects\">Effects ${Math.round(app.settings.effects*100)}%</label><input id=\"effects\" data-setting=\"effects\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\".05\" value=\"${app.settings.effects}\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"glyphs\">Controller prompts</label><select id=\"glyphs\" data-setting=\"glyphs\"><option value=\"ps\" ${app.settings.glyphs==='ps'?'selected':''}>PlayStation</option><option value=\"xbox\" ${app.settings.glyphs==='xbox'?'selected':''}>Xbox</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"contrast\">High contrast</label><input id=\"contrast\" data-setting=\"contrast\" type=\"checkbox\" ${app.settings.contrast?'checked':''}></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"motion\">Reduce motion</label><input id=\"motion\" data-setting=\"motion\" type=\"checkbox\" ${app.settings.motion?'checked':''}></div>`;\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('settings-back')}<span class=\"badge\">${dev?'LIVE TUNING':'MAKE YOURSELF COMFORTABLE'}</span></div>${heading(dev?'DEVELOPER TOOLS':'YOUR PREFERENCES',dev?'Tune the wobble.':'Settings',dev?'Changes apply immediately, including during a paused practice.':'Make the island feel like yours.')}<div class=\"stack\">${ranges}</div><div class=\"menu\">${dev?button('Reset tuning','reset-tuning','','ghost'):''}${button('Done','settings-back','','primary')}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='about'){\n    const section=(title,entries)=>`<h3>${title}</h3>${entries.map(entry=>`<p>${escape(entry)}</p>`).join('')}`;\n    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('title')}<span class=\"badge\">CREDITS</span></div>${heading('THE FINE PRINT','About the island','A Little Off Balance is a playful tribute, not medical advice.')}<div class=\"about-text\">${section('Source Information',Object.entries(about.sourceInformation).map(([key,value])=>`${key}: ${value}`))}${section('Testing Feedback',about.testingFeedback)}${section('Engine Feedback',about.engineFeedback)}${section('Prompt Feedback',about.promptFeedback)}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }else if(app.screen==='hub-card'){\n    content=panel(`${brand}${heading('AI HUB · GHOST MEDLEY','Ready to wobble?','Three events, one shared clock. Earn points and watch your fellow islanders as ghosts.')}<div class=\"menu\">${button('Ready','hub-ready','','primary')}${button('I need more time','hub-more','','ghost')}</div>${footer()}`);\n  }\n  ui.innerHTML=content;\n  app.focus=0;\n  const first=ui.querySelector('button:not(:disabled)');if(first&&app.inputKind==='gamepad')first.classList.add('focused');\n}\n\nfunction go(screen){app.screen=screen;render();}\nfunction begin(activity,options={}){\n  app.activity=activity;app.session=new ActivitySession(activity,{hard:app.hard,tuning:app.tuning,...options});app.paused=false;go('game');\n}\nfunction finish(){\n  if(!app.session)return;\n  app.result=app.session.result();\n  if(app.attract){app.attractIndex++;startAttract();return;}\n  if(app.hubRound){advanceHub();return;}\n  if(app.weigh){app.weigh.push(app.result.score/100);if(app.weigh.length<3){startWeigh();return;}profile().history.push(...app.weigh);profile().history=profile().history.slice(-3);app.weigh=null;save();go('weigh-result');return;}\n  if(app.medley){app.medley.scores[app.medley.player]+=app.result.score;go('results');return;}\n  if(profile()){const player=profile();player.drips+=app.result.drips;player.stars+=Math.max(0,app.result.stars-(player.played[app.activity.id]||0));player.played[app.activity.id]=Math.max(app.result.stars,player.played[app.activity.id]||0);if(app.activity.id==='finale'){player.revealed=true;save();go('reveal');return;}save();}\n  sound.effect('good');go('results');\n}\nfunction startWeigh(){const index=app.weigh.length;const names=['Still water','A gentle shift','Chase the breeze'];begin({...ACTIVITIES[0],id:['tree','heron','tax'][index],name:names[index],place:'Weigh-in',duration:8,ring:.38,instruction:['KEEP YOUR DOT IN THE RING','COUNTER THE DRIFT','STAY NEAR THE CENTER'][index]});}\nfunction startMedley(){const sequence=['tree','hoop','step'];const id=sequence[app.medley.event];begin({...ACTIVITIES.find(activity=>activity.id===id),name:`PLAYER ${app.medley.player+1} · ${ACTIVITIES.find(activity=>activity.id===id).name}`},{duration:20});}\nfunction startAttract(){app.attract=true;const sequence=['tree','hoop','step','header','slackline'];const activity=ACTIVITIES.find(item=>item.id===sequence[app.attractIndex%sequence.length]);begin(activity,{duration:12});}\nfunction leaveAttract(){app.attract=false;app.session=null;app.lastInput=performance.now();go('title');}\nfunction act(action,element){\n  sound.unlock();sound.effect('select');app.lastInput=performance.now();\n  if(app.attract){leaveAttract();return;}\n  if(action==='title'){app.session=null;app.medley=null;app.guest=null;go('title');}\n  else if(action==='slots')go('slots');\n  else if(action==='slot'){app.guest=null;app.slot=Number(element.dataset.index);if(!app.profiles[app.slot])app.profiles[app.slot]=makeProfile(`PLAYER ${app.slot+1}`);save();go('island');}\n  else if(action==='dropin'){app.guest=makeProfile('GUEST');app.guest.day=7;app.guest.revealed=true;app.returnScreen='island';go('island');}\n  else if(action==='island'){app.medley=null;app.weigh=null;go('island');}\n  else if(action==='intro'){app.activity=ACTIVITIES.find(item=>item.id===element.dataset.id);app.returnScreen='island';app.hard=false;sound.effect('voice');go('intro');}\n  else if(action==='hard'){app.hard=!app.hard;render();}\n  else if(action==='start')begin(app.activity);\n  else if(action==='weigh'){app.weigh=[];startWeigh();}\n  else if(action==='finale'){app.activity={...ACTIVITIES[0],id:'finale',name:'The Long Stand',place:'Pavilion',duration:45,ring:.32,quip:'A LITTLE HONESTY GOES A LONG WAY.'};app.returnScreen='island';go('intro');}\n  else if(action==='continue'){if(app.medley){app.medley.player++;if(app.medley.player>=app.medley.scores.length){app.medley.player=0;app.medley.event++;}if(app.medley.event>=3)go('medley-board');else startMedley();}else go('island');}\n  else if(action==='day-report')go('day-report');\n  else if(action==='next-day'){if(profile().day<7)profile().day++;save();go('island');}\n  else if(action==='family')go('family');\n  else if(action==='family-start'){app.medley={scores:Array(Number(element.dataset.count)).fill(0),player:0,event:0};startMedley();}\n  else if(action==='settings'){app.settingsFrom=app.screen;go('settings');}\n  else if(action==='settings-back')go(app.screen==='dev'?'pause':app.settingsFrom||'title');\n  else if(action==='dev')go('dev');\n  else if(action==='reset-tuning'){app.tuning={...DEFAULT_TUNABLES};if(app.session)app.session.tuning={...app.tuning};render();}\n  else if(action==='resume'){app.paused=false;go('game');}\n  else if(action==='leave'){app.session=null;app.medley=null;app.weigh=null;go(profile()?'island':'title');}\n  else if(action==='about')go('about');\n  else if(action==='hub-ready')globalThis.AIHub?.answer('ready');\n  else if(action==='hub-more')globalThis.AIHub?.answer('more');\n}\nui.addEventListener('click',event=>{const target=event.target.closest('[data-action]');if(target)act(target.dataset.action,target);});\nui.addEventListener('pointerover',event=>{const target=event.target.closest('button');if(target){ui.querySelectorAll('button.focused').forEach(item=>item.classList.remove('focused'));target.classList.add('focused');app.focus=Array.from(ui.querySelectorAll('button:not(:disabled)')).indexOf(target);}});\nui.addEventListener('input',event=>{const target=event.target;if(target.dataset.setting){const key=target.dataset.setting;app.settings[key]=target.type==='checkbox'?target.checked:target.type==='range'?Number(target.value):target.value;save();document.body.classList.toggle('high-contrast',app.settings.contrast);document.body.classList.toggle('reduce-motion',app.settings.motion);}if(target.dataset.tune){app.tuning[target.dataset.tune]=Number(target.value);if(app.session)app.session.tuning={...app.tuning};}});\nfunction menuMove(delta){const buttons=Array.from(ui.querySelectorAll('button:not(:disabled)'));if(!buttons.length)return;app.focus=(app.focus+delta+buttons.length)%buttons.length;buttons.forEach((item,index)=>item.classList.toggle('focused',index===app.focus));buttons[app.focus].focus();buttons[app.focus].scrollIntoView({block:'nearest'});}\nfunction pause(){if(app.screen==='game'&&!app.attract&&!app.hubRound){app.paused=true;go('pause');}else if(app.screen==='pause')act('resume');}\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{const wasNotice=notice();app.keyboardSeen=true;app.lastInput=performance.now();app.inputKind='keyboard';sound.unlock();if(app.attract){leaveAttract();return;}if(app.screen==='title'&&wasNotice)render();const key=event.key.toLowerCase();if(['arrowup','arrowdown','arrowleft','arrowright',' ','escape'].includes(key))event.preventDefault();if(event.repeat)return;app.keys.add(key);if(app.screen==='game'){if(key==='f')app.input.left=true;if(key==='j')app.input.right=true;if(key==='escape')pause();}else if(!['INPUT','SELECT'].includes(document.activeElement?.tagName)){if(key==='arrowdown'||key==='s')menuMove(1);else if(key==='arrowup'||key==='w')menuMove(-1);else if(key==='enter'){event.preventDefault();const buttons=Array.from(ui.querySelectorAll('button:not(:disabled)'));buttons[app.focus]?.click();}else if(key==='escape'){const backButton=ui.querySelector('.back');if(backButton)backButton.click();else if(app.screen==='pause')pause();}}});\nwindow.addEventListener('keyup',event=>app.keys.delete(event.key.toLowerCase()));\nwindow.addEventListener('blur',()=>app.keys.clear());\nwindow.addEventListener('pointerdown',event=>{app.lastInput=performance.now();if(app.attract){leaveAttract();return;}sound.unlock();if(event.pointerType==='mouse')app.inputKind='mouse';});\nui.addEventListener('pointermove',event=>{if(app.screen!=='game'||event.pointerType!=='mouse')return;const dial=event.target.closest('#dial');if(!dial)return;const rect=dial.getBoundingClientRect();app.mouse={x:Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(event.clientX-rect.left-rect.width/2)/(rect.width/2))),y:Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(event.clientY-rect.top-rect.height/2)/(rect.height/2)))};app.lastInput=performance.now();});\nwindow.addEventListener('gamepadconnected',()=>{app.lastInput=performance.now();if(app.screen==='title')render();});\n\nfunction gamepad(){const pad=Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).find(Boolean);if(!pad)return null;const down=index=>!!pad.buttons[index]?.pressed;const just=index=>down(index)&&!app.gamepadButtons[index];if(just(9)){app.lastInput=performance.now();app.inputKind='gamepad';pause();}if(app.screen!=='game'){if(just(12))menuMove(-1);if(just(13))menuMove(1);if(just(0)){const buttons=Array.from(ui.querySelectorAll('button:not(:disabled)'));buttons[app.focus]?.click();}if(just(1))ui.querySelector('.back')?.click();}else{if(just(4))app.input.left=true;if(just(5))app.input.right=true;}if(pad.axes.some(value=>Math.abs(value)>.2)||pad.buttons.some(item=>item.pressed)){app.lastInput=performance.now();app.inputKind='gamepad';if(app.attract){leaveAttract();return null;}}app.gamepadButtons=pad.buttons.map(item=>item.pressed);return pad;}\nfunction activityCue(session){\n  const activity=session.activity,time=session.elapsed;\n  if(activity.family==='reps'){\n    const phase=(time/3.2)%1;\n    const target=phase<.4?phase/.4:phase<.55?1:phase<.9?1-(phase-.55)/.35:0;\n    return `MATCH ${Math.round(target*100)}% · YOU ${Math.round(session.rep*100)}%`;\n  }\n  if(activity.family==='header')return Math.floor(time/2.4)%2===0?'← HEAD LEFT':'HEAD RIGHT →';\n  if(activity.family==='step')return Math.abs(time/.7-Math.round(time/.7))<.23?'STEP NOW · F OR J':'WAIT FOR THE BEAT';\n  if(activity.family==='jog')return 'ALTERNATE F AND J';\n  if(activity.family==='slack')return 'F / J TO WALK THE LINE';\n  if(activity.family==='jump')return 'SPACE / R2 TO JUMP';\n  if(activity.family==='hoop')return `CIRCLE THE STICK · ${Math.round(session.hoopLift*100)}% LIFT`;\n  if(activity.breath)return Math.sin(time*Math.PI*2/activity.breath)>0?'BREATHE IN · HOLD':'BREATHE OUT · RELEASE';\n  return 'KEEP THE DOT INSIDE THE RING';\n}\nfunction frame(now){\n  const dt=Math.min(.05,(now-(app.previous||now))/1000);app.previous=now;sound.update(dt);\n  if(app.hubClosed){requestAnimationFrame(frame);return;}\n  const pad=gamepad();\n  if(app.screen==='title'&&!globalThis.AIHub?.active&&now-app.lastInput>10000)startAttract();\n  if(app.screen==='game'&&app.session){\n    const seconds=document.getElementById('seconds');\n    if(app.hubRound&&globalThis.AIHub.time()<0){if(seconds)seconds.textContent=`${Math.ceil(-globalThis.AIHub.time()/1000)}`;app.input.left=false;app.input.right=false;requestAnimationFrame(frame);return;}\n    let x=Number(app.keys.has('d')||app.keys.has('arrowright'))-Number(app.keys.has('a')||app.keys.has('arrowleft'));\n    let y=Number(app.keys.has('s')||app.keys.has('arrowdown'))-Number(app.keys.has('w')||app.keys.has('arrowup'));\n    if(pad&&(Math.abs(pad.axes[0])>.12||Math.abs(pad.axes[1])>.12)){x=pad.axes[0];y=pad.axes[1];}else if(app.inputKind==='mouse'&&app.mouse){x=app.mouse.x;y=app.mouse.y;}\n    if(app.attract){const time=app.session.elapsed;x=app.session.activity.family==='hoop'?Math.cos(time*7):Math.sin(time*1.2)*.2;y=app.session.activity.family==='hoop'?Math.sin(time*7):Math.cos(time)*.2;if(Math.floor(time*3)%2===0)app.input.left=true;else app.input.right=true;}\n    if(app.driver==='perfect'){x=0;y=0;}\n    app.session.update(dt,{x,y,breath:app.keys.has(' ')||!!pad?.buttons[7]?.pressed,left:app.input.left,right:app.input.right});app.input.left=false;app.input.right=false;\n    const dot=document.getElementById('balance-dot'),meter=document.getElementById('meter'),score=document.getElementById('live-score'),cue=document.getElementById('live-cue'),dial=document.getElementById('dial');\n    if(dot){dot.style.left=`${50+app.session.dot.x*38}%`;dot.style.top=`${50+app.session.dot.y*38}%`;}\n    if(seconds)seconds.textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(app.session.duration-app.session.elapsed));\n    if(meter)meter.style.width=`${Math.min(100,app.session.elapsed/app.session.duration*100)}%`;\n    if(score)score.textContent=`${app.session.result().score} POINTS · ${app.medley?`PLAYER ${app.medley.player+1}`:'KEEP GOING'}`;\n    if(cue)cue.textContent=activityCue(app.session);\n    if(dial&&app.hubRound){dial.querySelectorAll('.ghost-dot').forEach(node=>node.remove());for(const ghost of Object.values(app.hubScores).slice(0,3)){if(!Number.isFinite(ghost?.x)||!Number.isFinite(ghost?.y))continue;const marker=document.createElement('span');marker.className='ghost-dot';marker.style.left=`${50+Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,ghost.x))*38}%`;marker.style.top=`${50+Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,ghost.y))*38}%`;dial.appendChild(marker);}}\n    if(app.hubRound&&now-app.hubClock>500){app.hubClock=now;const partial=app.hubTotal+app.session.result().score;globalThis.AIHub?.progress({score:partial,label:app.activity.name});globalThis.AIHub?.send({x:app.session.dot.x,y:app.session.dot.y,score:partial});}\n    if(app.session.finished)finish();\n  }\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n}\n\nfunction advanceHub(){if(app.hubEnded)return;app.hubTotal+=app.session.result().score;app.hubEvent++;if(app.hubEvent>=3){app.hubEnded=true;globalThis.AIHub?.result({score:app.hubTotal});app.result={...app.session.result(),score:app.hubTotal,stars:0,drips:0};app.hubRound=false;go('results');}else begin({...ACTIVITIES.find(item=>item.id===['tree','hoop','step'][app.hubEvent])},{duration:20});}\nfunction setupHub(){const hub=globalThis.AIHub;if(!hub?.active)return;hub.on('card',()=>{app.hubClosed=false;go('hub-card');});hub.on('start',()=>{app.hubClosed=false;app.hubRound=true;app.hubEnded=false;app.hubScores={};app.hubEvent=0;app.hubTotal=0;begin({...ACTIVITIES[0]},{duration:20});});hub.on('message',(data,from)=>{app.hubScores[from]=data;});hub.on('time-up',()=>{if(app.hubRound&&!app.hubEnded){const result=app.hubTotal+(app.session?.result().score||0);app.hubEnded=true;hub.result({score:result});app.result={...app.session.result(),score:result,stars:0,drips:0};app.hubRound=false;go('results');}});hub.on('end',()=>{app.hubRound=false;app.hubEnded=true;app.hubClosed=true;sound.context?.suspend();});hub.connect({mode:'ghost',seats:[1,4],card:true});hub.ready();}\nwindow.__GAME__={go:(screen,args={})=>{if(args.id)app.activity=ACTIVITIES.find(item=>item.id===args.id);if(screen==='game'&&app.activity)begin(app.activity);else go(screen);},state:()=>({screen:app.screen,day:profile()?.day,activity:app.activity?.id,elapsed:app.session?.elapsed,score:app.session?.result().score,attract:app.attract,profiles:app.profiles,hubScores:app.hubScores}),setDriver:skill=>{app.driver=skill;},get tunables(){return app.tuning;},finishActivity:()=>{if(app.session){app.session.elapsed=app.session.duration;app.session.finished=true;finish();}}};\nrender();setupHub();startWorld(app).catch(error=>{console.warn('3D island unavailable:',error.message);});requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
