"   1.50  hub → p0: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p1: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p2: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p3: card\",\"   1.50  p1 answers ready on the game's card\",\"   1.50  hub → p0: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p1: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p2: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p3: card\",\"   1.50  p2 answers ready on the game's card\",\"   1.50  hub → p0: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p1: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p2: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p3: card\",\"   1.50  p3 answers ready on the game's card\",\"   1.50  hub → p0: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p1: card\",\"   1.50  hub → p2: card\",\"   1.51  hub → p3: card\",\"   1.55  hub → p0: card\",\"   1.55  hub → p1: card\",\"   1.55  hub → p2: card\",\"   1.55  hub → p3: card\",\"   1.55  splash over: the round starts once every game has loaded\",\"   1.67  hub → p3: start in 2887 ms\",\"   1.69  hub → p1: start in 2861 ms\",\"   1.71  hub → p0: start in 2848 ms\",\"   1.73  hub → p2: start in 2829 ms\",\"   6.08  p0 left\",\"   6.21  hub → p1: leave 0 (left)\",\"   6.22  hub → p3: leave 0 (left)\",\"   6.25  hub → p2: leave 0 (left)\",\"   9.22  hub → p1: time-up\",\"   9.22  hub → p2: time-up\",\"   9.30  hub → p3: time-up\",\"   9.34  p1 → hub: result {\\\"score\\\":210}\",\"   9.40  p2 → hub: result {\\\"score\\\":470}\",\"   9.42  p3 → hub: result {\\\"score\\\":280}\",\"   9.42  round 1 played: finished — standings [[2],[3],[1],[0]]\",\"   9.53  hub → p3: end finished\",\"   9.58  hub → p2: end finished\",\"   9.61  hub → p1: end finished\",\"   9.75  conformance: PASS\"]}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
