{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_647","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: PROGRESS.md\n@@\n-- The last completed \"'`npm test` run passed 28 checks, including activity simulations, profile/day progression, family play, the WebGPU scene, and Chromium/Firefox/WebKit browser flows. Simultaneous Family Hour has since been implemented and its updated tests are in progress.\n+- The last completed `npm test` run passed 30 checks, including activity simulations, profile/day progression, simultaneous Family Hour, the WebGPU scene, and Chromium/Firefox/WebKit browser flows.\n@@\n-- Next: finish simultaneous Family Hour tests and viewport inspection; replace interview placeholders and rebuild the final artifacts.\n+- Next: finish paginated About/Credits, replace interview placeholders, inspect simultaneous Family Hour layouts, and rebuild and retest the final artifacts.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nDEV='\"'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846'; rg -n -o '.{0,140}app.screen===.about.{0,650}|.{0,90}action===.about.{0,160}|.{0,90}action===.title.{0,220}|.{0,100}function menuMove.{0,250}|.{0,90}\\\\.about-text.{0,350}' \\\"\"'$DEV/src/main.js\" \"$DEV/src/ui/style.css\" \"$DEV/src/ui/overrides.css\"; cat \"$DEV/src/data/about.js\"; tail -45 \"$DEV/tests/browser.py\"; sed -n '\"'1,90p' \\\"\"'$DEV/tests/browser.py\"'","aggregated_output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM PROGRESS.md\nA Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/src/ui/style.css:1:2%;border:1px solid #d7e5d8;background:white;border-radius:9px;padding:10px;color:#34564a}.about-text{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#607a6d}.about-text h3{color:#355a4a;font:600 17px 'Fredoka',sans-serif;margin:20px 0 5px}.about-text p{margin:0 0 9px}.toast{position:absolute;bottom:24px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#304c42;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 17px;font-size:12px;