{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_688","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"head -45 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/CREDITS.md'; sed -n '135,147p' 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/src/main.js'; sed -n '1,28p' 'A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846/src/world.js'; sed -n '1,180p' TASK.md | tail -80\"","aggregated_output":"# Credits (Pixel Engine 0.46.0)\n\nWhat this kit carries and where it came from, generated by `npm run bundle` from each built-in model's and texture's `source` (the data the engine repository's `npm run model -- credits` reads) and from the bundled packages' own licence files. Ship this file with a game built on the kit.\n\n## Models and textures\n\n- **The engine's own work**, made in its repository: 151 of the 151 library models (`MODEL_LIBRARY`), 126 of the 126 textures (`TEXTURE_LIBRARY`) and the built-in models (`assets/coin.glb`, `assets/hero.glb`, `assets/tree.glb`). Nothing to credit.\n- **kenney-castle** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/castle-kit/a395102d20-1711543616/kenney_castle-kit.zip. Models: kenney-castle/bridge-draw, kenney-castle/bridge-straight-pillar, kenney-castle/bridge-straight, kenney-castle/door, kenney-castle/flag-banner-long, kenney-castle/flag-banner-short, kenney-castle/flag-pennant, kenney-castle/flag-wide, kenney-castle/flag, kenney-castle/gate, kenney-castle/ground-hills, kenney-castle/ground, kenney-castle/metal-gate, kenney-castle/rocks-large, kenney-castle/rocks-small, kenney-castle/siege-ballista-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-ballista, kenney-castle/siege-catapult-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-catapult, kenney-castle/siege-ram-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-ram, kenney-castle/siege-tower-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-tower, kenney-castle/siege-trebuchet-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-trebuchet, ke