ILY HOUR · EVENT ${medley.event+1} / 3</div><h1>${medley.phase==='break'?'Time for a breather':escape(activity.name)}</h1><p>${medley.phase==='break'?'Next event starts shortly.':escape(activity.instruction)}</p></div><div class=\"family-clock\"><strong id=\"family-time\">${medley.phase==='break'?Math.ceil(medley.breakTime):EVENT_SECONDS}</strong><small>SECONDS</small></div></div>${medley.phase==='break'?`<div class=\"family-break\"><strong>ROUND COMPLETE</strong>${ranking.map((entry,index)=>`<div><span>${index+1}. ${familyName(medley.members[entry.index],entry.index)}</span><b>${entry.score} PTS</b></div>`).join('')}</div>`:`<div class=\"family-grid\">${medley.members.map((member,index)=>`<div class=\"family-lane\"><div class=\"family-lane-title\"><strong>${familyName(member,index)}</strong><span>${member.kind==='bot'?'BOT':member.kind==='keyboard'?'KEYBOARD':`PAD ${member.index+1}`}</span></div><div class=\"family-lane-body\"><div class=\"dial family-dial\"><span class=\"dot\" id=\"family-dot-${index}\"></span></div><div><strong id=\"family-score-${index}\">0</strong><small>POINTS</small></div></div><p id=\"family-cue-${index}\">${escape(activity.instruction)}</p></div>`).join('')}</div>`}</div><div class=\"family-game-tip\">F / J OR L1 / R1: STEP · ESC / OPTIONS: PAUSE</div></section>`;\nsrc/main.js:74:    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('title')}<span class=\"badge\">LOCAL MULTIPLAYER</span></div>${heading('PLAY TOGETHER','Family Hour','Join up to four players for three simultaneous events.')}<div class=\"family-roster\">${app.medley.members.map((member,index)=>`<span class=\"badge\">${familyName(member,index)} · ${member.kind==='pad'?`PAD ${member.index+1}`:member.kind.toUpperCase()}</span>`).join('')||'<span class=\"badge\">NO PLAYERS YET</span>'}</div><div class=\"menu\">${button('Join with keyboard','family-join','', 'ghost')}${button('Add a bot','family-bot','', 'ghost')}${button('Start the medley','family-start',app.medley.members.length?'':'disabled','primary')}</div><p class=\"family-help\">ENTER: join keyboard · CROSS / A: join controller<br>SPACE / OPTIONS: start · B: add bot</p>${footer()}`);\nsrc/main.js:83:    const pages=aboutPages(),current=pages[app.aboutPage];\nsrc/main.js:84:    content=panel(`<div class=\"topline\">${back('title')}<span class=\"badge\">CREDITS</span></div>${heading('THE FINE PRINT',current.title,current.description)}<div class=\"about-text\">${current.body}</div><div class=\"about-navigation\"><button class=\"button ghost\" data-action=\"about-prev\" ${app.aboutPage===0?'disabled':''}>← Previous</button><span>${app.aboutPage+1} / ${pages.length}</span><button class=\"button primary\" data-action=\"about-next\" ${app.aboutPage===pages.length-1?'disabled':''}>Next →</button></div><p class=\"about-help\">← / → or L1 / R1: change page${current.title==='Full kit credits'?' · ↑ / ↓: scroll':''}</p>${footer()}`,'about-screen');\nsrc/main.js:144:  else if(action==='family-join')familyJoin('keyboard');\nsrc/main.js:145:  else if(action==='family-bot')familyJoin('bot');\nsrc/main.js:146:  else if(action==='family-start'&&app.medley.members.length)startMedley();\nsrc/main.js:153:  else if(action==='about'){app.aboutPage=0;go('about');}\nsrc/main.js:154:  else if(action==='about-prev'||action==='about-next'){app.aboutPage=Math.max(0,Math.min(aboutPages().length-1,app.aboutPage+(action==='about-next'?1:-1)));render();}\nHTTP/1.0 200 OK\r\n{\"name\":\"a-little-off-balance\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"private\":true,\"type\":\"module\",\"scripts\":{\"build\":\"node tools/build.mjs\",\"test\":\"node tests/run.mjs\"}}\n# Progress\n\n## Project\n- Title selected by `crypto.randomInt` from 50 candidates: **A Little Off Balance**.\n- Deliverable basename: `A Little Off Balance-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221846`.\n- Read `TASK.md` and `PLAN.md`; downloaded the unmodified Pixel Engine 0.46.0 and AI Hub client into the development folder.\n- Implemented the activity catalog, unstable balance physics, progression, synthesized audio, 3D island, screens, local profiles, family sessions, and AI Hub client integration. The standalone HTML builds successfully.\n\n## Work plan\n1. Read the complete design and integration documentation; obtain the unmodified engine and hub client.\n2. Build the core game, island, activities, progression, input, audio, and multiplayer.\n3. Bundle the standalone HTML, run focused playthrough and viewport tests, and fix findings.\n4. Complete About/Credits, `exit-interview.json`, and this progress record.\n\n## Current checkpoint\n- Source lives in the development folder's `src/`; build the standalone deliverable with `npm run build` there.\n- The last completed `npm test` run passed 30 checks, including activity simulations, profile/day progression, simultaneous Family Hour, the WebGPU scene, and Chromium/Firefox/WebKit browser flows.\n- The viewport matrix reports 24 clean phone, foldable, tablet, and desktop configurations. Selected WebKit and Chromium screenshots have been inspected.\n- Fixed an unsupported-WebGPU startup overlay and an oversized title encountered during browser testing.\n- The official AI Hub harness passed one-, two-, and four-player simulations, including latency, packet loss, and host/player departures. Chromium, Firefox, and WebKit opened the standalone `file://` build.\n- Fixed an AI Hub ready/welcome race and phone gameplay hint overflow. Added a CSS fallback character for browsers without WebGPU.\n- Next: finish paginated About/Credits, replace interview placeholders, inspect simultaneous Family Hour layouts, and rebuild and retest the final artifacts.\n- The implementation is a simplified interpretation of the extensive plan: activities share the island scene rather than having full bespoke animated environments.\n\n## Constraints\n- Only work in this directory and the required development subfolder; use OS-assigned localhost ports and stop only our own processes.\n- Keep `pixel-engine.js` unchanged; synthesize audio in code; default music volume 10%.\n- Test small phones, tablets, wide screens, WebKit, and scripted game flows; no physical controller or real iOS device is available.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
