ble, controller-first vertical slice.\",\n    \"The scope combines a large simulation, multiplayer and a standalone deliverable.\",\n    \"Balancing the breadth of activities with cross-browser verification.\",\n    \"Prioritize required features and define an explicit minimum for each.\"\n  ],\n  \"aiHub\": {\n    \"name\": \"A Little Off Balance\",\n    \"tagline\": \"A very serious game about a very wobbly week.\",\n    \"description\": \"Balance, breathe, and bravely face a talking scale on a cozy island. Play a week of delightfully questionable fitness or challenge friends in a three-event medley.\",\n    \"type\": \"Game\",\n    \"genre\": \"Sports\",\n    \"source\": \"Wii Fit\",\n    \"series\": \"Wii Fit\",\n    \"players\": \"1–4\",\n    \"controls\": \"Left stick / WASD: lean; R2 / Space: breathe; L1/R1 or F/J: step; Escape / Options: pause.\",\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"3d\",\n      \"sports\",\n      \"comedy\",\n      \"arcade\",\n      \"versus\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
